d3be60ca-c2a9-4227-9570-23f82a4a27a9	b582e346-3983-4888-a50f-647ae9c954f8	5dfa65ce-14b0-450b-a3d8-125ddfea110d	Q3 Sprint Planning	{"body":"During the sprint planning, U_TEST2 reported that we're doing well with our work pace. The team decided to focus on setting up an observability feature as part of their next project goals while also moving from using Docker Compose for deployments to a more robust system called OpenShift by July end.","headline":"Planning for OpenShift Migration and Observability in Q3","action_items":["{\\"task\\":\\"Start planning for the migration from Docker Compose to OpenShift.\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"U_TEST4, with coordination by U_TEST2 and input from platform team.\\"}"],"key_decisions":["Focus sprint efforts on Observability setup","Transition deployment methodology to OpenShift"]}	Engineering	\N	standard	15
