ature update delayed to prioritize stability.", "action_items": ["Project Management to monitor and communicate any further changes to the release schedule.", "Engineering team to complete the required testing and development work."], "key_decisions": ["The new proxy feature is scheduled for version 5.1, with a possibility of moving to 5.2.", "The update will not be included in the 4.22 version."]}	2026-05-09 13:20:00.215094+00	\N
