echnical delays, there is a concern regarding how these changes are communicated to internal stakeholders. Because the team may not be able to meet the original deadlines, Patricia de las Heras Granaglia is meeting with relevant parties to discuss how to manage expectations and maintain professional relationships with those affected by the schedule changes.", "headline": "Technical issues and network downtime force a potential delay to the migration schedule.", "action_items": ["Perform weekend maintenance to restore network connectivity", "Resolve software blockers preventing the start of migration preparations", "Patricia de las Heras Granaglia to meet with stakeholders to align on communication strategy"], "key_decisions": ["Migration start date potentially shifted to May 6th", "Weekend maintenance window confirmed for system repairs"]}	2026-05-09 13:21:58.494479+00	\N
