re a smooth transition for the US migration.", "headline": "Coordinating automated systems for the upcoming datacenter move.", "action_items": ["Sebastian Rodriguez Isaziga to meet with Scott J Wright to review current load balancer automation tools.", "Sebastian Rodriguez Isaziga, Michael, and @rspazzol to create a plan for connecting all network automation tasks."], "key_decisions": ["The team will move away from isolated fixes toward a single, connected automation process for the migration."]}	2026-05-09 13:24:18.779898+00	\N
