8cfbccf2-9ad9-4195-b5c9-5adf80558ce0	2ccadeb8-8aef-41e1-9a8e-06483e6c5841	VM migration status	["error validation", "UAT testing"]	\N	0.9	gemini-3.1-flash-lite	classify-v1	{"body": "Patricia de las Heras Granaglia reported that 8 out of 9 VMs triggered a 'Dynamic Disk Validation' error during the migration process. She confirmed that these errors are false positives as the validation logic was not applicable to the current scenario.\\n\\nOne VM failed to migrate and is queued for a retry. Following the successful migration of the remaining instance, the ITSO team will initiate service validation within the UAT environment.", "headline": "VM migration status update regarding Dynamic Disk Validation errors and UAT progression.", "action_items": ["Retry migration for the single failed VM.", "ITSO team to begin service validation in UAT once all VMs are migrated."], "key_decisions": ["Dynamic Disk Validation errors are to be ignored as they are not applicable to the current migration scenario."]}	{"body": "Patricia de las Heras Granaglia noted that while most virtual machines showed an error message during the move, these errors do not affect the system and can be disregarded. One machine failed to move successfully and will be attempted again.\\n\\nOnce the final machine is moved, the technical team will begin testing the service in the user acceptance testing (UAT) environment to ensure everything is working correctly.", "headline": "Update on virtual machine migration progress and upcoming testing phase.", "action_items": ["Technical team to retry the migration for the one failed machine.", "ITSO team to perform service testing in the UAT environment."], "key_decisions": ["The error messages received during the migration will be ignored."]}	2026-05-09 13:16:15.098796+00	\N
