The team will use the client's existing process for investigating issues instead of creating a new one."]}	2026-05-09 13:16:17.790698+00	\N
89455ecb-5a23-49ac-b8ef-e62002b209a3	dc158e53-57c8-426c-bba4-9f8a80c2b017	Infrastructure migration and risk	["etcd performance", "VM provisioning", "OpenShift migration"]	\N	0.9	gemini-3.1-flash-lite	classify-v1	{"body": "Raffaele Spazzoli addressed ongoing concerns regarding etcd disk performance, requesting clarification on why the risk remains flagged by Rydekull. The discussion shifted to the heritage restore workflow, which requires a new VM provisioning process, VM-level customization, and file-level restoration.\\n\\nRaffaele Spazzoli noted that the provisioning process on OpenShift is currently at 80% completion according to Nitesh. Consequently, this dependency is now formally classified as a blocker for all production VM migrations.", "headline": "Infrastructure migration status, etcd disk latency risks, and OpenShift provisioning blockers.", "action_items": ["Rydekull to address etcd disk speed risk concerns with Raffaele Spazzoli.", "Shebi to verify if VM-level customization can be executed via ServiceNow."], "key_decisions": ["The OpenShift provisioning process is established as a hard blocker for production VM migrations."]}	{"body": "Raffaele Spazzoli raised questions regarding persistent concerns about storage speed for the system's core database. He requested that Rydekull reach out directly to discuss these risks further.\\n\\nAdditionally, the team outlined the steps required to move existing systems to the new environment. Because the setup process for the new virtual machines is not yet fully finished, Raffaele Spazzoli has officially paused all moves of live production systems until this work is completed.", "headline": "Migration progress is currently blocked by pending infrastructure setup tasks.", "action_items": ["Rydekull to discuss storage performance concerns with Raffaele Spazzoli.", "Shebi to confirm if the system setup process can be handled through the current service request tool."], "key_decisions": ["Production system moves are halted until the new infrastructure setup is fully operational."]}	2026-05-09 13:16:26.244646+00	\N
