172195bb-2452-48d9-ab97-19ddb6dbfa8a	f5d0a640-73b5-44cf-a8a2-355193535ff1	DMZ deployment architecture	["meeting documentation", "diagram collaboration"]	\N	0.9	gemini-3.1-flash-lite	classify-v1	{"body": "Raffaele Spazzoli reported discrepancies in the meeting minutes provided by Vijay regarding the DMZ deployment architecture. Following coordination with Michele, Raffaele Spazzoli issued an amendment to the documentation to ensure technical accuracy.\\n\\nTo progress the architecture design, Raffaele Spazzoli is tasked with developing deployment diagrams for the DMZ. He intends to leverage existing architectural artifacts created by Alex and has requested that @Rydekull provide access to these base diagrams.", "headline": "DMZ deployment architecture documentation and diagramming requirements.", "action_items": ["@Rydekull to share existing architecture diagrams created by Alex.", "Raffaele Spazzoli to develop updated DMZ deployment architecture diagrams."], "key_decisions": ["Amended meeting minutes issued to correct inaccuracies in the DMZ deployment architecture discussion."]}	{"body": "Raffaele Spazzoli noted that the notes from a recent meeting with the HSBC team were incorrect. With the agreement of the original author, Vijay, and assistance from Michele, Raffaele Spazzoli sent out a corrected version of the meeting summary.\\n\\nThe team is now moving forward with creating visual diagrams for the DMZ deployment. Raffaele Spazzoli plans to use previous work by Alex as a starting point and has asked @Rydekull to share those files so he can begin the update.", "headline": "Updating project documentation and planning for network security architecture.", "action_items": ["@Rydekull to provide previous diagrams to Raffaele Spazzoli.", "Raffaele Spazzoli to create new deployment diagrams for the DMZ."], "key_decisions": ["Corrected the official meeting notes regarding the DMZ deployment plan."]}	2026-05-09 13:16:38.835015+00	\N
