03e398a2-cb40-4cd0-93cd-eb92ffd98093	51efbb33-6c08-4b28-8d6d-ad1c652d1611	Network infrastructure configuration error	["LACP misconfiguration", "Network build status"]	\N	0.95	gemini-3.1-flash-lite	classify-v1	{"body": "James Force reported a critical configuration error regarding the network build-out external to the lab environment. Specifically, LACP (Link Aggregation Control Protocol) has not been enabled on the switch side, resulting in a failure to aggregate links and forcing the infrastructure to operate on single-port throughput.\\n\\nMichael and Rushi have been notified of the LACP misconfiguration and are currently managing the remediation process to restore expected link aggregation functionality.", "headline": "LACP misconfiguration identified in network build-out outside of lab environment.", "action_items": ["Michael and Rushi to remediate LACP configuration on the switches."], "key_decisions": []}	{"body": "James Force alerted the team to a setup error in the new network infrastructure located outside of the lab. Because a specific communication setting between devices was missed, the network is currently only using a fraction of its intended capacity.\\n\\nMichael and Rushi are aware of the situation and are working to fix the configuration. This update is intended to keep stakeholders informed should any performance questions arise during the build process.", "headline": "Network connectivity issues identified due to configuration errors in the new build.", "action_items": ["Michael and Rushi to resolve the network configuration error."], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-09 13:19:15.875791+00	\N
