 'slow':66 'specif':25 'sql':26 'statement':27 'system':142 'tabl':32,56,152 'take':94 'thread':16 'tool':103 'use':136 'user':46,55,71,138,147 'util':42 'way':160 'within':53
4f0cf8a4-99f5-4f8c-a43d-b6d52d39a4c1	fbb5b99d-5f4f-430b-8f04-fcda828eb9ac	Database Performance Issue	["Engineering"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	phi3:mini	classify-v1	{"body": "Dana, a member of Engineering, reported to project stakeholders that there is a significant delay in user query response times for an analytics dashboard. The root cause appears to be related to full-table sequential scans by PostgreSQL's planner on the events table.", "headline": "Critical PostgreSQL database performance issue identified with sequential scans on the events table.", "action_items": ["Investigate indexing strategies", "Consult with Dana for potential optimizations"], "key_decisions": []}	{"body": "Dana informed the team that users are experiencing delays when accessing data through an analytics tool. The problem seems to be because our database software is scanning every row in a large table, which takes too long and makes things slow for everyone using it.", "headline": "Database slowdown affecting analytics dashboard performance needs attention.", "action_items": ["Dana will look into ways of making the data access faster", "The team will discuss how to improve response times"], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-21 10:54:33.641877+00	'access':86,130 'affect':70 'analyt':36,71,90 'appear':41 'attent':75 'caus':40 'consult':62 'critic':1 'dana':14,64,76,121 'dashboard':37,72 'data':87,129 'databas':3,68,99 'delay':28,84 'discuss':135 'engin':18 'event':12,57 'everi':103 'everyon':118 'experienc':83 'faster':131 'full':47 'full-tabl':46 'identifi':6 'improv':138 'index':60 'inform':77 'investig':59 'issu':5 'larg':107 'long':112 'look':123 'make':114,127 'member':16 'need':74 'optim':67 'perform':4,73 'planner':54 'postgresql':2,52 'potenti':66 'problem':93 'project':21 'queri':31 'relat':44 'report':19 'respons':32,139 'root':39 'row':104 'scan':9,50,102 'seem':94 'sequenti':8,49 'signific':27 'slow':116 'slowdown':69 'softwar':100 'stakehold':22 'strategi':61 'tabl':