b695f1e5-be11-4d06-801d-b9cb1b79d840	85dd8cb5-0d2a-49a9-b420-f693e71d12f7	oc-mirror tuning and issues resolution	["image mirror failures investigation", "sync problems with operators"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	phi3:mini	classify-v1	{"body": "U_PHILIP_740C6823 reports successful tuning of oc-mirror jobs by configuring --parallel-images to 4 and --parallel-layers to 5, resulting in a runtime reduction to 6 hours with a target of <5 hours. To address ongoing mirror failures, the team has disabled the falcon-operator due to token expiry constraints and the Infoscale operator due to lack of verified requirements.\\n\\nFurthermore, U_PHILIP_740C6823 implemented a workaround for image signature verification by creating /etc/containers/registries.d/registry.k8s.io.yaml. This configuration disables sig-store checks for images where the signature storage on us-central1-docker.pkg.dev is unreachable via the current proxy environment.", "headline": "Optimization of oc-mirror jobs and resolution of image synchronization failures.", "action_items": ["Continue investigation into image mirror failures as requested by Prerana.", "Target further runtime reduction to under 5 hours."], "key_decisions": ["Set --parallel-images to 4 and --parallel-layers to 5 for oc-mirror jobs.", "Disabled sync for falcon-operator and Infoscale operator.", "Created registry.k8s.io.yaml to bypass sig-store checks for unreachable signature registries."]}	{"body": "U_PHILIP_740C6823 has successfully optimized the image mirroring process, reducing the total job time to 6 hours with a goal of reaching under 5 hours. This was achieved by adjusting the parallel processing settings to better handle the workload.\\n\\nTo resolve ongoing errors, the team has stopped attempting to sync two specific software operators that were causing failures due to security token expirations and unclear requirements. Additionally, a configuration change was made to bypass signature checks for certain images that were being blocked by the network proxy, ensuring they can be mirrored successfully.", "headline": "Improvements to image synchronization speed and resolution of mirror errors.", "action_items": ["Continue troubleshooting remaining image mirror failures.", "Work toward the goal of reducing total job duration to under 5 hours."], "key_decisions": ["Optimized mirroring settings to improve job speed.", "Disabled synchronization for the falcon-operator and Infoscale operator to prevent errors.", "Updated network configuration to allow images that were previously blocked by the proxy."]}	2026-05-26 03:27:25.695497+00	\N
