af14effb-d1f0-44a8-aa48-5aecc0edf9dd	79fea343-0bb2-4e1e-aa93-93701e4deda7	Storage offload incompatibility	["NetApp integration", "Customer support"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	gemini-3.1-flash-lite	classify-v1	{"body": "U_RAFFAE_9DC03E2E, representing the Engineering workstream for NetApp integration and Customer Support issues related to Storage Offload (SO) compatibility. The conversation highlighted that a customer attempted using their own SO process alongside NetApp's proprietary Shift Toolkit; however, this resulted in operational conflicts due to differing architectural designs between the two systems.", "headline": "NetApp's storage offload incompatibility with customer tool", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": []}	{"body": "U_RAFFAE_9DC03E2E, from the Engineering team working on integrating NetApp solutions for a customer. The issue discussed was that when trying to move data out of NetApp systems back into local environments through an external tool (the Storage Offload process), it didn't work as expected because these tools are designed differently and can interfere with each other.", "headline": "Customer's attempt at using their own storage offload with NetApp", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-25 12:39:49.643523+00	\N
3db6e4e8-f6ba-4f2e-8b9a-6b12b8c70ab5	26c772bd-7146-4349-b6cb-0f4bfdd5e2a7	Network Build Issue	["Engineering"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	phi3:mini	classify-v1	{"body": "U_JAMES_F3856179 reported a critical network build issue where the engineering team has inadvertently omitted Link Aggregation Control Protocol (LACP) configuration for all ports outside of their immediate lab environment. This oversight results in each switch port functioning independently, which could potentially limit bandwidth and affect redundancy plans within our infrastructure.", "headline": "[Network Build Issue] LACP misconfiguration on switches causing single-port operation.", "action_items": ["Michael to address the LACP misconfiguration", "Rushi to verify correct implementation of single-port operation as a temporary measure"], "key_decisions": []}	{"body": "U_JAMES_F3856179 brought up an issue where the engineering team made a mistake in setting up our network. They forgot to set something called LACP on many of the switches, which means that instead of using multiple ports together for better speed and reliability (like having several lanes open at once), they're only using one port per device right now.", "headline": "[Network Build Issue] Switch ports not working together due to configuration error.", "action_items": ["Michael is responsible for fixing this LACP issue", "Rushi will ensure the temporary single-port setup works correctly"], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-25 13:21:57.199672+00	\N
