c1680e89-836c-456b-93bb-ad8ac5acdf5c	bb764c70-5994-4373-87d8-237be290e7aa	GitHub and Nexus infrastructure	["Global deployment strategy", "Disaster recovery planning", "NDA compliance"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.9	gemini-3.1-flash-lite	classify-v1	{"body": "U_ALEXAN_D03599F6 initiated a meeting with Michele, the owner of GitHub / Nexus to discuss expanding their cloud-based services across various geographic locations and data centers. The conversation delved into strategies for global deployment while ensuring disaster recovery plans are robust enough to handle potential outages or system failures.", "headline": "Discussion on global deployment and disaster recovery for GitHub & Nexus infrastructure", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": []}	{"body": "U_ALEXAN_D03599F6 had a meeting with Michele, who owns the companies behind GitHub and Nexus. They talked about how to make sure their online tools can be used by people all around the world in different countries or regions (global deployment strategy). Also, they discussed what should happen if something goes wrong like an outage (disaster recovery planning), which has been difficult because Michele is not yet legally allowed to share certain details due to a non-disclosure agreement. To address this issue and continue their important conversation about keeping services running smoothly even when problems occur, they plan for Michele to get the necessary legal permission (NDA compliance).", "headline": "Meeting about expanding GitHub & Nexus services worldwide and planning for possible issues", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-25 16:47:54.339013+00	\N
