89c74a10-daae-4abb-be36-667412301e8e	2e590429-30fb-4e0a-b152-224cd582f105	VM Migration Debugging Session	["Shared Disks Issue", "Windows Failover Cluster issue"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	phi3:mini	classify-v1	{"body": "Martin Necas from engineering joined the debugging session to address migration challenges. For shared disks, a workaround was applied by ensuring VMs are running before migrating so that metadata is captured correctly for IP continuity on targeted VSphere environments.", "headline": "VM Migration Debugging Session: Shared Disks and Failover Cluster issues", "action_items": ["Martin Necas will investigate potential error sources for Windows Failover Cluster initialization and shared disks consumption."], "key_decisions": ["Implementing verbose warnings during pre/post-check parallelism to inform users about the process pattern."]}	{"body": "The team, with Martin from engineering leading the session, tackled issues related to migrating VMs that share disks. They found a solution where they make sure each virtual machine is running before moving it so their network settings are preserved.", "headline": "VM Migration Debugging Session: Addressing Shared Disks & Failover Clusters", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": ["Starting verbose warnings for parallel pre/post-check migration processes."]}	2026-05-25 19:32:01.931557+00	\N
ce008cf3-b8db-4303-9ed7-4dedb30ac454	46db996a-abea-4384-849e-d19328198d99	Cilium WAF/IDS delivery delay	["Project timeline adjustment", "OVN alternative evaluation"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	gemini-3.1-flash-lite	classify-v1	{"body": "The engineering team, led by @U_RAFFAE_9DC03E2E, discussed the delay in delivering WAF (Web Application Firewall) and IDS (Intrusion Detection System) capabilities using Cilium. The initial timeline was not met due to unforeseen technical challenges with integrating these components into Kubernetes-based infrastructure within Sheffield's project scope.", "headline": "[WAF and IDS] Delivery Delay from Sheffield Meeting", "action_items": ["{\\"task\\":\\"Confirm understanding with @Shebi\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"@U_RAFFAE_9DC03E2E\\"}", "{\\"task\\":\\"Re-evaluate OVN (Open Virtual Network) as an alternative solution for WAF/IDS delivery.\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"Undetermined - to be discussed in the next meeting.\\"}"], "key_decisions": ["Cilium will deliver WAF and IDS capabilities in November instead of the initially agreed time."]}	{"body": "The engineering team, including @U_RAFFAE_9DC03E2E, is facing a delay in delivering the WAF (Web Application Firewall) and IDS (Intrusion Detection System) components. The original deadline has been pushed back to November due to technical issues with integrating these systems into their Kubernetes setup.", "headline": "[WAF and IDS] Delivery Delay from Sheffield Meeting", "action_items": ["{\\"task\\":\\"Get confirmation from @Shebi on the new timeline\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"@U_RAFFAE_9DC03E2E\\"}", "{\\"task\\":\\"Look into OVN (Open Virtual Network) as a potential alternative for WAF/IDS delivery.\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"Undetermined - to be discussed in the next meeting.\\"}"], "key_decisions": ["The delivery of WAF and IDS is now expected in November."]}	2026-05-25 19:52:11.964279+00	\N
