295d4d03-0db4-4470-9209-641d8fac41ec	9d20bdc2-f28f-4fef-887a-8083006b5653	Migration support model	["Hypercare planning", "Consulting engagement"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.9	gemini-3.1-flash-lite	classify-v1	{"body": "U_PATRIC_80EFC8EB, an engineer at ACN & HSBC, has developed a consulting support model tailored to migrations and hypercare planning. The document shared on Google Presentation outlines the proposed approach with specific strategies for ensuring minimal disruption during migration phases while maintaining high-quality service delivery through robust hipercare protocols.", "headline": "Presentation of Consulting Support Model for Migrations and Hypercare", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": []}	{"body": "U_PATRIC_80EFC8EB, working with ACN & HSBC's engineering team, has created a plan to help during company migrations. The presentation he shared explains how they will keep services running well without interru0bly when moving systems around and ensure constant care for customers throughout this process.", "headline": "Proposal of Support Model for Migrations and Continuous Care", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-25 20:12:24.515442+00	\N
e69eb9ba-874e-4088-b86e-323423ee227b	53adaf8c-7ef8-4f13-9d89-b81da9e443f3	Storage system error	["Infrastructure troubleshooting"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.9	gemini-3.1-flash-lite	classify-v1	{"body": "U_GOOGLE_19CE3B0A reported a 302 Pure Storage Error, indicating potential issues with the underlying infrastructure. The thread suggests that James Force is already aware of this error and may be involved in troubleshooting.", "headline": "[302 pure storage error] Identified by U_GOOGLE_19CE3B0A", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": []}	{"body": "U_GOOGLE_19CE3B0A brought up a critical issue where the project encountered an HTTP 302 response code, which typically means that something went wrong with accessing stored data. This error points to potential problems within our storage system or infrastructure setup.", "headline": "[302 pure storage error] Reported by U_GOOGLE_19CE3B0A", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-25 20:22:37.063662+00	\N
427e037a-1b3d-4ea3-9107-6cf9da9e4b32	5213aafc-9d3e-4c0c-8f40-933ddbd75c68	Migration Pilot Execution	["Training Coordination", "Progress Tracking"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	gemini-3.1-flash-lite	classify-v1	{"body": "Carina Almeida, a member of the team involved in Migration Pilot 2 (MP-2), initiated an update on May 5th regarding MP-2's commencement and its end date. The migration process is scheduled to start at 10:00 AM UK time today with completion expected by Thursday, as per U_PATRIC_80EFC8EB from the Engineering workstream.", "headline": "Migration Pilot Execution Update with Progress Tracking", "action_items": ["{\\"task\\":\\"Monitor migration statistics\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"Carina Almeida\\"}", "{\\"task\\":\\"Review and provide feedback on training materials for the team involved in MP-2.\\",\\"responsible\\":[\\"Rydekull\\",\\"@janine\\",\\"@jfeind\\"]}"], "key_decisions": []}	{"body": "Carina Almeida, from the Engineering team working on Migration Pilot 2 (MP-2), sent an update about MP-2 starting today at a specific time in UK. The pilot is set to end by Thursday.", "headline": "Migration Pilot Execution Update and Training Feedback Request", "action_items": ["{\\"task\\":\\"Check the migration progress using Carina's spreadsheet link\\",\\"responsible\\":[\\"Project Manager\\"]}", "{\\"task\\":\\"Look at and comment on training materials for MP-2 participants.\\",\\"responsible\\":[\\"Rydekull\\",\\"@janine\\",\\"@jfeind\\"]}"], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-25 20:32:38.273442+00	\N
90a56a05-b071-43f6-bd7c-881baf6c286c	e420c85e-c022-4389-8449-37efe77b7ec6	RBAC and secret management	["HashiCorp Vault", "Access control", "Task delegation"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	gemini-3.1-flash-lite	classify-v1	{"body": "The discussion revolves around the implementation of Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) for both manifest access via SSH keys, as well as Virtual Network Computing (VNC), within a security context. The focus is on managing secrets and password rotation through HashiCorp Vault to enhance local account security.", "headline": "Update on RBAC and secret management using HashiCorp Vault requested by @Shebi.", "action_items": ["{\\"task\\":\\"Provide an update on the proposed solution for RBAC using Hashi Corp Vault\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"@U_IMAGE_3227E706\\"}", "{\\"task\\":\\"Take over from @U_IMAGE_3227E706 regarding secret management and password rotation with regards to local accounts using HashiCorp Vault\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"@janine\\"}"], "key_decisions": []}	{"body": "Project manager @Shebi asked about the progress of a proposed plan to improve access control and manage secrets, which includes using HashiCorp Vault. This project is important because it will help keep passwords safe by rotating them regularly. However, there seems to be confusion as someone named Praveen was supposed to receive this update but missed out.", "headline": "Need update on RBAC solution for better account security.", "action_items": ["{\\"task\\":\\"Explain the RBAC solution and how HashiCorp Vault will help with password rotation\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"@U_IMAGE_3227E706\\"}", "{\\"task\\":\\"Take over from @U_IMAGE01 regarding secret management for local accounts using HashiCorp Vault while they are away this week.\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"@janine\\"}"], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-25 20:42:44.377053+00	\N
184e3a93-34e8-4721-92b5-cfc598e5b514	3cbe94c8-8127-42ad-895b-c5392b00e638	VM Performance Issue in Oracle DB on RHEL 9	["Oracle Database Migration"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	phi3:mini	classify-v1	{"body": "U_JENS_9E9831E8, a team member in Engineering, reported observing significant latency and throughput degradation when migrating Oracle Database instances (gbl25239315 & gbl25239316) to cluster 104. The discrepancy between the expected performance on Vsphere versus actual results within VMware's infrastructure prompted a review of resource allocation, network settings, and database configurations.", "headline": "Oracle DB on RHEL 9 VMs exhibit performance drops post-migration to cluster 104.", "action_items": ["{\\"task\\":\\"Perform an in-depth analysis to pinpoint the root cause(s) for performance degradation\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"U_JENS_9E9831E8\\"}"], "key_decisions": []}	{"body": "Engineer U_JENS_9E9831E8 noticed that after moving Oracle DB instances to the 'cluster 104' on RHEL 9, they aren't performing as expected. The team is concerned about this drop in speed and reliability for users relying on these databases.", "headline": "Oracle Database VMs are running slower in a new cluster.", "action_items": ["{\\"task\\":\\"Investigate why the Oracle DB VMs are slower after moving them to 'cluster 104'.\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"U_JENS_9E9831E8\\"}"], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-25 20:50:45.760352+00	\N
