2a4153d3-47d4-4e7f-9060-40039c334295	587e8d0d-d5e1-4e8d-9cc0-e6fd02d76471	VM Re-iping Challenges	["Network Configuration Issues", "Operating System Considerations"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	phi3:mini	classify-v1	{"body": "U_RAFFAE_9DC03E2E highlighted challenges faced during a recent attempt to remap IP addresses for some virtual machines (VMs) within Hong Kong. The process revealed unforeseen complications when dealing with OS-mounted NAS, VPNs, and proxies that are impacted by VM re-iping in New York.", "headline": "Discussion on the complexities of re-iping VMs in HK and NY, including network configuration issues.", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": []}	{"body": "U_RAFFAE_9DC03E2E shared that they encountered difficulties when trying to change the IP address for a group of VMs in Hong Kong. They found out these issues also exist back at their New York office because changing one machine's IP affects others, like NAS devices and internet services such as VPNs and proxies.", "headline": "Challenges with changing the IP addresses of some virtual machines and how it affects other systems like NAS, VPNs, and proxies.", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-25 21:02:15.699237+00	\N
