c2b767dc-c059-4a62-b646-9b6ab09591e4	497b1599-ba2b-471c-bebd-e6c5f2ac3845	Migration Upgrade Pilot Phase3 - Bundle3a	["VM Migration Failure"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	phi3:mini	classify-v1	{"body": "During the latest steering call, Anne Maskell provided an update on the current status of the Migration Upgrade Pilot. She confirmed that prechecks were successful and initiated a live migration process for VM assets associated with Bundle3a. However, Alexander Rydekull reported back at 12:29 PM regarding one specific virtual machine (VM) which encompassed an array of 37 disks attempting to be migrated but failed due to unspecified issues.", "headline": "Engineering reports a failed migration attempt for VM with multiple disks in Pilot Phase3 - Bundle3a.", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": []}	{"body": "Anne Maskell gave an update on today's steering call about Pilot Phase3 - Bundle3a. She mentioned that everything was going well up until now, with prechecks passing and migrations starting as planned for 60 minutes or so from the time of her report at around noon.", "headline": "Engineering team encounters a problem during VM migration in the latest project phase.", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-25 21:50:04.300455+00	\N
