her investigation.\\"}", "{\\"task\\":\\"Contact support ticket system\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"[Customer Networking Team]\\",\\"details\\":\\"After providing diagnostic info, raise a new issue in RH's helpdesk with @U_PHILIP_740C6823 for more assistance.\\"}"], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-26 07:30:45.841382+00	\N
