afbad425-9082-45f8-abad-7ed636f0f283	b20ffba8-e154-4a86-aac6-088b43564409	OC Mirror Sync Issue and Solution Discussion	["Technical Support"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	phi3:mini	classify-v1	{"body": "U_PHILIP_740C6823 engaged with Alex from the OC mirror dev team regarding a customer's Nexus or Proxy server issues that limit parallel image and layer processing. The current synchronization process is time-consuming, taking over 30 hours for full sync operations.", "headline": "Discussion on improving OC Mirror sync efficiency for specific updates.", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": ["OC Mirror in version 4.22 will allow cherry picking specific updates to merge with an existing catalog instead of replacing it."]}	{"body": "U_PHILIP_740C6823 brought to the team's attention a customer struggling with slow image synchronization due to server limitations. The current process is inefficient, often taking over 30 hours and sometimes even up to 24 hours for full sync operations.", "headline": "Team discusses sync issues and upcoming improvements for OC Mirror.", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": []}	2026-05-26 12:04:58.572137+00	\N
