2e869a9c-3207-42a0-9aca-f38669c1e023	547a2d95-c37a-4f21-b711-33bf6fca1193	Re-IPing Strategy and Service Owner Responsibilities	["VMWare Provisioning Choices", "Migration Approaches Discussed"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	phi3:mini	classify-v1	{"body": "The team at NY meetings, including @U_RAFFAE_9DC03E2E (unknown), discussed the complexities of re-provisioning services. Several issues were identified that require resolution before proceeding with a VMWare or openshift provision in service owners' hands.", "headline": "Discussion on re-provisioning and migration strategies for service owners.", "action_items": ["{\\"task\\":\\"Identify dependencies through questionnas and scrubs of firewalls, LB, NAS configurations, VPNs, proxy\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"@U_RAFFAE_9DC_E2E\\"}", "{\\"task\\":\\"Consider automation for DNS changes as per Vinay's suggestion and discuss the feasibility of other proposed methods.\\",\\"responsible\\":[\\"Vinay\\",\\"@Philip Jones\\"]}"], "key_decisions": ["Service provisions will be done either by VMware, soon to openshifts after setting the date", "Migration approach prefers from VMWare to OCP using storage offload over network"]}	{"body": "The team, including @U_RAFFAE_9DC03E2E (unknown), had discussions about how to tackle the issues found during their meetings. They're considering two main options for updating services: using VMware or moving towards openshift soon after setting a date.", "headline": "Exploring options for updating service infrastructures with a focus on re-provisioning and migration strategies.", "action_items": ["{\\"task\\":\\"Find out what the service owners need and how they are connected using questionnaires.\\",\\"responsible\\":\\"@U_RAFFAE_9DC03E2E (unknown)\\"}", "{\\"task\\":\\"Look into automating DNS changes as suggested by Vinay, while also considering other methods for service updates.\\"}"], "key_decisions": ["Service provisions will be done either by VMware, soon to openshifts", "Migration approach prefers from VMWare to OCP"]}	2026-05-25 21:16:06.178804+00	\N
