e78e5b23-15e9-4de5-88d2-f1862d79ac5e	bcd8641a-6aa4-46c4-98a7-77bdd67d7e9b	Migration resource scheduling	["Staffing coverage", "Holiday planning"]	89544343-b14b-4504-944b-463ad88bb59a	0.95	gemini-3.1-flash-lite	classify-v1	{"body": "U_CARINA_D5667D0C, the migration team leader, has rescheduled a critical VM migration to avoid conflict with an upcoming German bank holiday. The revised schedule involves migrating approximately 230 virtual machines across Wednesday and Thursday of next week but requires additional coverage on Thursday due to non-working hours in Germany.", "headline": "Migration resource scheduling for bank holiday coverage in Germany", "action_items": ["Confirm team members available to cover Thursday's migration and potential day swap."], "key_decisions": ["Migration scheduled for the following three days, with a focus on ensuring full resource availability despite bank holiday."]}	{"body": "The migration team, led by U_CARINA_D5667D0C from the Engineering workstream, needs to move about 230 virtual machines across Wednesday and Thursday. However, since Germany has a bank holiday on Thursday next week, they need more hands-on deck for that day's migration tasks.", "headline": "Planning VM migrations around German bank holiday", "action_items": ["Team needs confirmation on who can cover extra shifts for Thursday's migration and consider swapping workdays with others."], "key_decisions": ["Migration rescheduled to accommodate the German team members’ availability due to national public holiday."]}	2026-05-25 22:13:36.119553+00	\N
