40d5a190-2e6b-4b9d-9d55-3f099f8df337	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778207708.000008	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778207708.000008", "text": "[dependency diagram] @janine I updated the diagram with what I know and shared it with you, if you want to beautify it as you said. We could also try to distinguish between internal services and cloud services: https://app.diagrams.net/#G1WuWbiHUoNhXvp4vDrY1ROF3uFFhscuvY#%7B%22pageId%22%3A%22TuniqSDQRX1W3yqkenBl%22%7D . We need to send it back by EOD\\napp.diagrams.net\\nFlowchart Maker & Online Diagram Software\\ndraw.io is free online diagram software for making flowcharts, process diagrams, org charts, UML, ER and network diagrams", "type": "message", "user": "Raffaele Spazzoli"}]	{"Raffaele Spazzoli"}	2026-05-08 17:54:21.445567+00	2026-05-12 05:07:53.918218+00	delivered	2026-05-09
85bf7097-66fc-4d45-836b-b703c23d2c4e	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778656685.000005	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778656685.000005", "text": "Good catch. Let's increase the initial delay on the readiness probe from 10s to 30s. The app takes longer to boot in production.", "type": "message", "user": "Alice"}]	{Alice}	2026-05-13 06:32:40.649086+00	2026-05-25 11:13:35.22726+00	delivered	2026-05-22
c6add2de-5588-49d6-ac16-60e413b76238	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778656323.000003	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778656323.000003", "text": "Agreed. I'll add the cache action for node_modules. We also need to split the build and test stages to run them in parallel.", "type": "message", "user": "Bob"}]	{Bob}	2026-05-13 06:32:40.607888+00	2026-05-25 11:13:35.241245+00	delivered	2026-05-22
65d65b9f-cdac-473a-aff7-2f0e9cac9675	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778656142.000002	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778656142.000002", "text": "We should add a Docker layer cache to the GitHub Actions workflow. The pipeline needs to cache node_modules between builds.", "type": "message", "user": "Alice"}]	{Alice}	2026-05-13 06:32:40.589756+00	2026-05-25 11:13:35.280609+00	delivered	2026-05-22
ab63bd62-6a1d-4b19-9fff-292c365ffb29	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778655900.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778655900.000000", "text": "The CI/CD deployment pipeline failed again on the staging environment. The Docker container build is timing out during the npm install step.", "type": "message", "user": "Alice"}]	{Alice}	2026-05-13 06:32:40.539749+00	2026-05-25 11:13:35.250818+00	delivered	2026-05-22
b99458b0-f389-44c7-8337-0f83a10c188a	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778656806.000006	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778656806.000006", "text": "I'll create a PR for both the pipeline cache fix and the Kubernetes readiness probe update. This should reduce deployment time from 15 minutes to under 5.", "type": "message", "user": "Bob"}]	{Bob}	2026-05-13 06:32:40.662409+00	2026-05-25 11:13:35.257509+00	delivered	2026-05-22
8dbc269c-8b88-4248-a1d5-279f5b6b8d70	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778656021.000001	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778656021.000001", "text": "Yeah I noticed too. The build cache was invalidated because someone pushed a package.json change. The npm install takes 8 minutes without cache.", "type": "message", "user": "Bob"}]	{Bob}	2026-05-13 06:32:40.566042+00	2026-05-25 11:13:35.266739+00	delivered	2026-05-22
1859e155-4b2a-4aaf-9552-56a462210d5b	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778656504.000004	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778656504.000004", "text": "The deployment to Kubernetes also failed because the health check endpoint timed out. The pod readiness probe needs adjustment.", "type": "message", "user": "Charlie"}]	{Charlie}	2026-05-13 06:32:40.626188+00	2026-05-25 11:13:35.273069+00	delivered	2026-05-22
f25f6990-87c7-4b7d-8b38-e96fc60e3fb0	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778203325.000005	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778203325.000005", "text": "@Philip Jones @James Force @rspazzol How did the initial enrollment with Vault look like now? A new cluster is created, we generate something on our end, and then send it to Vault team who adds our vault? or something like that, right? Then we have a vault connected to our cluster, and then we consume secrets from there.", "type": "message", "user": "Alexander Rydekull"}]	{"Alexander Rydekull"}	2026-05-08 17:54:21.331669+00	2026-05-12 05:07:53.928727+00	delivered	2026-05-09
75501a9f-a1d4-4954-80b3-7959f8617485	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778237410.000010	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778237410.000010", "text": "Hi Anne! That is wonderful news! Add me to the list of happy folks!!! Thank for the bright news on a Monday morning !", "type": "message", "user": "Stefanie Chiras"}]	{"Stefanie Chiras"}	2026-05-08 17:54:21.493858+00	2026-05-12 05:07:53.936148+00	delivered	2026-05-09
3b26393f-4a1b-4a96-accb-2174479ebcd0	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778201515.000115	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778201515.000115", "text": "[Build Standup Call]: @Philip Jones keep me honest here, so we give more context to @janine before joining the call. For building new clusters with ACM the secret is getting refreshed unexpectedly, causing the InfraEnv variables and the ISO image to fluctuate. Because the ISO keeps changing, the ISO attachment process frequently fails, throwing “ISO is not ready” errors. the team is relying on a manual process to create and apply these secrets to bypass the failures. To fix this, we need to finalize our automated secret management strategy. We need an automated way to pull these secrets, integrate them with Vault for proper password rotation, and reliably replicate them down to the managed clusters without breaking the deployment flow.", "type": "message", "user": "Sebastian Rodriguez Isaziga"}]	{"Sebastian Rodriguez Isaziga"}	2026-05-08 17:54:23.843133+00	2026-05-09 13:55:00.304692+00	pending_retry	2026-05-09
