2ee65712-6640-4ce7-b7f2-7d1b434ea559	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778676305.000005	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778676305.000005", "text": "Once the index is added, the query should drop from 45 seconds to under 200 milliseconds. Let's monitor query execution time after the migration.", "type": "message", "user": "Dana"}]	{Dana}	2026-05-13 06:32:53.313496+00	2026-05-25 11:13:35.292907+00	delivered	2026-05-22
a828292b-b3bf-4ab1-8992-f40164347ac0	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778214793.000013	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778214793.000013", "text": "Looks like the migrated VM is having issues; people joined the bridge to troubleshoot. Red Hat not required to join so far", "type": "message", "user": "Patricia de las Heras Granaglia"}]	{"Patricia de las Heras Granaglia"}	2026-05-08 17:54:21.57144+00	2026-05-12 05:07:53.978857+00	delivered	2026-05-09
