b7fb5438-d6a1-492c-8341-33cbfba89da8	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777700400.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777700400.000000", "text": "[constrained countries OCP topology] based on dennis feedback that he does not want 1- or 2- node clusters, the recommendation is to purchase all new HW to be able to deploy 3 node clusters everywhere. should be around 100x3 servers, something like that. Bottom line for us, we might not need to support remote workers. Rushi was happy about it.", "type": "message", "user": "U_RAFFAE_9DC03E2E"}]	{U_RAFFAE_9DC03E2E}	2026-05-25 11:51:51.61996+00	2026-05-26 21:25:38.832755+00	summarized	2026-05-26
3a570333-32a9-439e-8986-d40353e94468	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778197481.000041	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778197481.000041", "text": "[Migration update]\\nPilot Phase #1\\nPlanned retro for Friday -> I will share yesterday’s feedback on that meeting\\n3rd migration event starts today\\nPilot Phase #2\\nConcerns of finding workloads: legacy, no one knows the applications\\nAction for Red Hat: figure out % of legacy over installed base we have found in prior engagements\\nAgree on Scope: Current volumes agreed 230VMs across 93 services\\nNext Steps: Start looking at the Comms to the ITSO. MIoX does not support it yet so comms will be done manually considering sequencing communications properly to not overload ITSOs mailboxes\\nDiscussion on what to prioritize in MIoX: Comms Integrations vs more patterns. The first will give us more volume than the second\\nNext Steps: Baseline the plan. I’d like to be on tomorrow’s meeting\\nCountry Pilot UK\\nCreating the first cutoff of the plan. Will be shared by Monday. Start Date 2 weeks after completing Phase 2\\nScope calculated based on : Fabric -> Services -> VM.\\nVimal to provide a view of Fabric readiness for UK", "type": "message", "user": "Patricia de las Heras Granaglia"}]	{"Patricia de las Heras Granaglia"}	2026-05-08 17:54:22.650364+00	2026-05-12 05:07:54.142314+00	delivered	2026-05-09
