, "user": "U_PATRIC_80EFC8EB", "thread_ts": "7777701200.000000"}, {"ts": "7777701205.000000", "text": "[Delivery Report]\\nHi team,  Can you all please put in your updates from last Thursday to today to the template: https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1AZG2KXxtiPZAKWUXIVvEu9h8F1UjaLIB/edit?slide=id.g3d367ed5e9f_0_0#slide=id.g3d367ed5e9f_0_0 I will be sending this out at 11am tomorrow. Please ensure that you update the main body by close of business today. Thank you all.", "type": "message", "user": "U_ROSALI_5BB9C3D4", "thread_ts": "7777701200.000000"}, {"ts": "7777701206.000000", "text": "[Delivery Report] This is due to go out by noon. Please start to update it so we can have it ready to sent on time. @Rydekull, @rspazzol, @Shebi, @janine, @Philip Jones, @James Force ,@ricardo gregorio, @Petros ,@pdelashe appreciate it. https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1AZG2KXxtiPZAKWUXIVvEu9h8F1UjaLIB/edit?slide=id.g38b58e86daa_0_13#slide=id.g38b58e86daa_0_13", "type": "message", "user": "U_ROSALI_5BB9C3D4", "thread_ts": "7777701200.000000"}, {"ts": "7777701207.000000", "text": "[Delivery Report]\\nPlease start to update the Delivery Report for this week (Thurs to Wed).", "type": "message", "user": "U_DELIVE_7E00CC56", "thread_ts": "7777701200.000000"}, {"ts": "7777701208.000000", "text": "[Delivery Report]\\nPlease start to update the Delivery Report for this week (Thurs to Wed).", "type": "message", "user": "U_DELIVE_7E00CC56", "thread_ts": "7777701200.000000"}, {"ts": "7777701209.000000", "text": "[Delivery Report] is due to go out at noon GMT. Last chance to get your updates in: Delivery Report. Thank you!", "type": "message", "user": "U_JOHANN_669B3727", "thread_ts": "7777701200.000000"}]	{U_ROSALI_5BB9C3D4,U_GOOGLE_ECE7F183,U_PATRIC_80EFC8EB,U_DELIVE_7E00CC56,U_JOHANN_669B3727}	2026-05-25 11:51:51.731888+00	2026-05-27 08:35:38.016843+00	summarized	2026-05-27
98c3e454-1563-49d6-862d-a7c3713c0da4	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778228390.000110	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778228390.000110", "text": "[Automation WorkGroup Discussion (Gareth pull me on this call)] - This is in line with the Data architecture workstream I am currently working into:\\nIT Service Portal (ITSP) to OpenShift Integration\\nCurrently, the IT Service Portal offering only supports VMware for VM provisioning and VM-level automation (such as resizing CPU and memory). Nilesh is working on extending this capability to OpenShift, and these features have been added to the platform backlog.\\nData Governance and Advanced VM Settings\\nI raised concerns regarding the end-to-end data governance from the ITSP portal to actual VM provisioning. While basic compute resizing is in the backlog for OpenShift, not all VMware settings will translate directly. I emphasized the need to automate these rules, shared the relevant documentation links fro Confluence (Data Architecture Document), and offered to help consolidate and test the process.\\nAction Items & Next Steps:\\nGareth & Nilesh: They will have a meeting (not planed yet) to plan the next steps regarding the backlog and automation mapping for the IT Service Portal.", "type": "message", "user": "Sebastian Rodriguez Isaziga"}]	{"Sebastian Rodriguez Isaziga"}	2026-05-08 17:54:23.780294+00	2026-05-12 05:07:54.164885+00	delivered	2026-05-09
