1f4c3844-59e5-4dc5-b983-897e2b448f2a	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777713300.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777713300.000000", "text": "[Migration Today]\\nAs Ann said, VMs have been organized to remove those sitting on DELL so the plan for today is 3 budles, one at 10.00 and another 2 at 13.00. Arpit and Snehal will be supporting the first one, and Sebastian and anyone else working today, will be supporting the 13.00. Let's hope they go smoother than yesterday'simage.png Patricia de las Heras Granaglia  [9:41 AM]\\n@Shebi can you share with me the XFS rollout plan? I was not able to keep track of all messages. What needs to be done and when will it be done. Tnx!", "type": "message", "user": "U_PATRIC_80EFC8EB"}]	{U_PATRIC_80EFC8EB}	2026-05-25 11:51:53.182998+00	2026-05-26 22:08:48.326527+00	summarized	2026-05-26
