66bc63f5-d7b4-4c2d-ba28-25ac0cb3a3f6	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778229368.000128	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778229368.000128", "text": "I was pulled into a call regarding Microsoft Entra ID authentication failing on one cluster. On that cluster, the customer had a production proxy configured, and authentication was not working.\\nThe same Entra ID setup was configured on another cluster using a different proxy, where authentication was working as expected.\\nDuring debugging, I found that the non-working cluster was unable to reach Microsoft Graph (graph.microsoft.com), which was being blocked by the proxy.\\nAs a temporary workaround, I suggested allowing access to that endpoint. I also advised the customer to open a support case with Microsoft or obtain an official list of required URLs. Since dependencies may change (for example, due to outages or load balancing across different endpoints), relying on a single allowed domain may not be sufficient—it's better to follow Microsoft’s documented and supported endpoint list.", "type": "message", "user": "Arpit Tolani"}]	{"Arpit Tolani"}	2026-05-08 17:54:24.015994+00	2026-05-12 05:07:54.214263+00	delivered	2026-05-09
