e51d43cf-8e3f-436a-92c4-dee16242fa85	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777704100.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777704100.000000", "text": "[Storage Offloading] RH Engineering provided infos on how to configure storage offloading from Dell --> Pure. will be tested once 104 is back to healthy. this is not a migration pattern that's included in the upcoming pilot phase 2", "type": "message", "user": "U_JANINE_71F80BBD"}]	{U_JANINE_71F80BBD}	2026-05-25 11:51:52.131135+00	2026-05-26 23:03:30.655389+00	summarized	2026-05-26
e2c001cf-5bdd-42ff-9878-dbf5d5e01a9e	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778209070.000170	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778209070.000170", "text": "[any to any storage offload migrations] any to any means between different storage vendors. This should work, but it seems not to. I have involved Roy from engineering but he has be slow to answer as he was on PTO. Customer is attempting migration from HPE to Dell. There is a certain urgency on this and I am about to go on PTO. @janine can you pick this up? Let's sync on this today before I disappear.", "type": "message", "user": "Raffaele Spazzoli"}]	{"Raffaele Spazzoli"}	2026-05-08 17:54:24.553067+00	2026-05-12 05:07:54.308024+00	delivered	2026-05-09
