92f4ff67-5557-4df8-8a6a-f0ad5b9346f4	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777705000.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777705000.000000", "text": "[SDN, OVN-K vs. Isovalent / Cilium] I'm a little curious, we should just check up the analysis we did before and see how many features will be in 4.22 now from the original ask.", "type": "message", "user": "U_ALEXAN_D03599F6"}]	{U_ALEXAN_D03599F6}	2026-05-25 11:51:52.324109+00	2026-05-26 23:30:23.704146+00	summarized	2026-05-26
