bccaf621-7621-44f8-a6b8-a4cf3731c152	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777715100.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777715100.000000", "text": "PJ Build Update:\\n\\nPortworx CSI driver updated to 26.1.1 on all lab clusters.\\nLargely successful, but 102 cluster has a MAJOR issue with snapshots... There are >4700 vm snapshots and volumesnapshotcontent resources present, but there are 0 volumesnapshots! This problem is breaking the CSI migration pods and causing them to fail :(\\nWe don't have an easy solution or explanation. If we manually create a snapshot, no new snapshot instance is created, just the content and the virtmachine upgrades.", "type": "message", "user": "U_PHILIP_740C6823"}]	{U_PHILIP_740C6823}	2026-05-25 11:51:53.335327+00	2026-05-27 02:24:28.910853+00	summarized	2026-05-26
