881a30a1-45b6-4a07-ae0f-508e9b9f3fbd	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777716400.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777716400.000000", "text": "@Carina Almeida, @janine, @Rosemary Lynch and @James Force, for info the customer is still having issues with cluster hkoclu307. Specifically, that three nodes aren't able to register, having built successfully via ACM.\\n\\nI've exhausted my troubleshooting on this and did request a few days ago that they capture all the diagnostic and debug info from myself and their networking team and then raise a RH support ticket.\\n\\nWe can ssh into the problem nodes. I've checked the br-ex and it looks good. Both interfaces in the bond are good. It can nslookup and curl other endpoints e.g the default ingress controller. It just can't build a route to the API IP. No route to host and a tcpdump show arp requests being sent with no response. Their networking team is saying there's no issues on their side...", "type": "message", "user": "U_PHILIP_740C6823"}]	{U_PHILIP_740C6823}	2026-05-25 11:51:53.415691+00	2026-05-27 02:42:08.212169+00	summarized	2026-05-26
