14decee3-8ff9-45b5-8def-1b38d1d28006	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777716600.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777716600.000000", "text": "Hi all,\\nI think it was mentioned last year, by @rspazzol @Sam Marland, in the other eos channel about demo of Network Observability. During the Sheffield workshops @Nikos mentioned \\"Network Observability Operator to be used for Non-HIC and data to be fed to HSBC cyber team\\".\\nWhat is the plan for this?\\n\\nI need to read, but does anyone know what extra it provides (compare to the current node network metrics available)???", "type": "message", "user": "U_RICARD_02F5C49D"}]	{U_RICARD_02F5C49D}	2026-05-25 11:51:53.423793+00	2026-05-27 02:45:30.52618+00	summarized	2026-05-26
7bdeab0c-3356-4b15-8f11-375503a6dcd6	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777716700.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777716700.000000", "text": "Delivery Report]\\nThis is due to go out by tomorrow noon. Please start to update it so we can have it ready to sent on time. Can the following review & update by tomorrow 11am please?\\nPlatform slide still empty  @Rydekull, @rspazzol, @Shebi, @janine, @Philip Jones, @James Force ,@ricardo gregorio, @Petros ,@pdelashe appreciate it. https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1AZG2KXxtiPZAKWUXIVvEu9h8F1UjaLIB/edit?slide=id.g38b58e86daa_0_13#slide=id.g38b58e86daa_0_13 (edited)", "type": "message", "user": "U_ROSALI_5BB9C3D4"}]	{U_ROSALI_5BB9C3D4}	2026-05-25 11:51:53.432572+00	2026-05-27 02:48:41.930987+00	summarized	2026-05-26
fcf3fa5a-bade-4f29-a815-61c3edd2217a	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777716000.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777716000.000000", "text": "I just noticed....\\nThe customer seems to have issue with the prod clusters. To the point that they were completely down, due to network changes. While I understand that there's a certain process and procedure in place on how to deal with it, it'd be nice if we can at least spread the news amongst ourselves so it doesn't come as a surprise to us. (edited)", "type": "message", "user": "U_ALEXAN_D03599F6"}]	{U_ALEXAN_D03599F6}	2026-05-25 11:51:53.395756+00	2026-05-27 02:32:51.572219+00	summarized	2026-05-26
