bbef0e20-4de3-4490-86b6-813261149004	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777718900.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777718900.000000", "text": "Update on the plan for oauth proxy. \\nhey Sam, we are still assessing all the work that needs to happen. at this point we believe that making this change for the oauth stack is something we will target to backport to 4.22. we are still looking at all the edge cases, so we don't have a firm commitment on exactly what date it would land, but we're trying to get this done in the 5.0 release timeframe and then work on a backport once that's done.\\n\\nwe're tracking all that effort here https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/OCPSTRAT-3174, and I'll keep regular weekly updates in that ticket\\nFrom a private conversation | May 6thPatricia de las Heras Granaglia  [10:22 AM]\\n[Delivery Report]\\nLast chance to add your comments to the delivery report before it goes out: https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1AZG2KXxtiPZAKWUXIVvEu9h8F1UjaLIB/edit?slide=id.g39a69ff70c8_3_0#slide=id.g39a69ff70c8_3_0", "type": "message", "user": "U_SAM_F28235E5"}]	{U_SAM_F28235E5}	2026-05-25 11:51:53.616923+00	2026-05-27 03:21:05.981726+00	summarized	2026-05-26
