a4431f4b-5d9e-4165-9c0b-9be2121a303d	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777719000.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777719000.000000", "text": "Case - https://access.redhat.com/support/cases/#/case/04442406\\n\\nAbhishek has raised this case over night. It appears linked to the issue from yesterday with the machine with many disks. My intention is to share this ASAP in the migration-blockers-nda-customer channel for focus. It is going to be difficult to get focus with everyone about to travel to Summit. @Rydekull I think you're closest to this from a debug perspective. Can you share any more context you've seen during debugging so we can help engineering?", "type": "message", "user": "U_SAM_F28235E5"}]	{U_SAM_F28235E5}	2026-05-25 11:51:53.626136+00	2026-05-27 03:23:47.469113+00	summarized	2026-05-26
