8eaf5529-4f9e-4a37-8d63-9e73dd03b138	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777722500.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777722500.000000", "text": "We are seeing some issues with what are probably failed migrations. On cluster uk 302 for example, we have a LOT of PVC's stuck Terminating with the PV showing as LOST. The corresponding PV exists, but it looks like the disappointed:\\n\\nI might need some help digging into this, but the implications are signficant as each PV is eating up disk space and the PVC's are seemingly stuck in a \\"Terminating\\" state.", "type": "message", "user": "U_PHILIP_740C6823"}]	{U_PHILIP_740C6823}	2026-05-25 11:51:53.834684+00	2026-05-27 04:21:07.621571+00	summarized	2026-05-26
bef86497-7d4f-421e-b8ca-ccd7df3bd882	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777722600.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777722600.000000", "text": "Issue 1 — MTV: Orphaned Storage Resources After Failed VM Migrations. Status: Red Hat bug MTV-5546 | Active ticket #04426565 | :red_circle: Escalation Pending\\n\\nCan someone give me an update on this issue? Do we have a fix that we're trialing?", "type": "message", "user": "U_SAM_F28235E5"}]	{U_SAM_F28235E5}	2026-05-25 11:51:53.838289+00	2026-05-27 04:23:18.359694+00	summarized	2026-05-26
649c4906-e7c5-4c6e-be49-5e8619da788e	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777722700.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777722700.000000", "text": ":heart: A massive THANK YOU to this incredible team :heart:\\n\\nTeam,\\n\\nToday was one of those high-pressure days where escalations and queries were coming from all sides. But watching how this team responded made me incredibly proud and reminded me exactly why I love working at Red Hat.\\n\\nEvery single person; across Delivery, the Account Team, Engineering, TAM and Support; stayed focused, maintained professionalism, and handling the pressure.\\n\\nMore than just delivering technically, what amazed me most was how we supported each other. We didn't just collaborate professionally; we looked out for each other through a tough day. It is incredibly reassuring to know we have each other's backs like this.\\n\\nToday showed the absolute best of Red Hat. I feel incredibly lucky to work alongside such an amazing, dedicated group of people, and it’s teams like this that make us want to grow together.\\n\\nThank you all for your hard work, your resilience, and for being such a stellar team. Let's keep this amazing energy going! :pray:", "type": "message", "user": "U_CARINA_D5667D0C"}]	{U_CARINA_D5667D0C}	2026-05-25 11:51:53.842258+00	2026-05-27 04:25:33.899523+00	summarized	2026-05-26
