b6ccd481-acb2-4177-9a6a-0e1aa1de8df9	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778203575.000255	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778203575.000255", "text": "[RBAC (Manifest & VNC Access)] @Shebi in Build status call toady Praveen asked for an update on the proposed solution that you committed to outline. Has this been sent & he missed it? It's around secret management and password rotation on local accounts using Hashi Vault. I've asked @janine if she can take this over from you as you will be away from desk for most of this week.", "type": "message", "user": "Rosemary Lynch"}]	{"Rosemary Lynch"}	2026-05-08 17:54:25.592824+00	2026-05-12 05:07:55.309609+00	delivered	2026-05-09
