d2639dd7-39b3-4dfb-8d31-6008eb2758d4	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778203027.000067	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778203027.000067", "text": "[Delivery Report] This is due to go out by noon. I've made a start on the updates but as I was out yesterday there are definite gaps. Can the following review & update by 11am please. @Rydekull, @rspazzol, @Shebi, @janine, @Philip Jones, @James Force ,@ricardo gregorio, @Petros ,@pdelashe appreciate it. https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1AZG2KXxtiPZAKWUXIVvEu9h8F1UjaLIB/edit?slide=id.g38b58e86daa_0_13#slide=id.g38b58e86daa_0_13\\nGoogle Drive", "type": "message", "user": "Rosemary Lynch"}]	{"Rosemary Lynch"}	2026-05-08 17:54:23.085511+00	2026-05-12 05:07:55.32684+00	delivered	2026-05-09
