2da819a7-152a-4f78-ab52-0a740f06dc42	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778211617.000257	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778211617.000257", "text": "[Performance]\\n@Shebi @Rydekull\\nToday I got a preview on a document to be shared with us, which shows performance differences on a VM migrated to 104. It is a Oracle DB on RHEL 9 and there are quit some drops on Cluster 104 vs the Vsphere.\\nThe VMs in question are gbl25239315 and gbl25239316.\\nSudhir is on top of it and wants to analyze the document to search for potential culprits. A call is to be scheduled this week. Once I got the doc I will make it available in our Teams Chat.", "type": "message", "user": "Jens Feind"}]	{"Jens Feind"}	2026-05-08 17:54:25.615815+00	2026-05-12 05:07:55.401361+00	delivered	2026-05-09
