2ccadeb8-8aef-41e1-9a8e-06483e6c5841	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778208112.000052	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778208112.000052", "text": "Looks like 8 out of 9 VMs threw that error, but the error can be ignored as the validation (Dynamic Disk Validation) did not apply in this scenario; however one machine was not migrated and they are going to re-try it. ITSOs will start validating the service wich all their VMs migrated (the UAT one) (edited)", "type": "message", "user": "Patricia de las Heras Granaglia"}]	{"Patricia de las Heras Granaglia"}	2026-05-08 17:54:22.834579+00	2026-05-12 05:07:55.435949+00	delivered	2026-05-09
bcd8641a-6aa4-46c4-98a7-77bdd67d7e9b	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777707700.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777707700.000000", "text": "[Migration team cover for the next two weeks]\\n\\n@pdelashe – I  mentioned we would address this on Monday, but I’ve moved it up as I realised there is a bank holiday in Germany next week.\\n\\nTeam,\\n\\n\\nNext week, the bank is planning to migrate approximately 230 VMs across Wednesday, Thursday, and Friday. Since Thursday is a bank holiday in Germany, we need to ensure coverage. @atolani @ricardo gregorio @rspazzol @Rydekull do you have availability to cover for @Shebi and @jfeind? We need one arch and one Consultant for Thursday.\\nMay 22nd is a Red Hat Recharge Day. We are currently coordinating with ESS to see if they can cover migrations that day. However, I would like to know if anyone is interested in a day swap: working on the 22nd and taking your Recharge Day at another date. This would help us with coordination. \\n\\n\\nPlease let me know your availability for the cover and the swap by lunch time tomorrow. :pray:\\n\\nTagging who's not tagged yet: @janine @James Force @Philip Jones @Petros", "type": "message", "user": "U_CARINA_D5667D0C"}]	{U_CARINA_D5667D0C}	2026-05-25 11:51:52.751889+00	2026-05-27 06:07:04.467523+00	summarized	2026-05-26
