ba83853c-24e7-46a0-9ea0-1097a3a138bb	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778220154.000094	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778220154.000094", "text": "[arch documentation] we need to finish the following pieces of architecture docs in two weeks. Please let's sure we deliver on this, as red hatter we are notoriously slow/bad at this part..:\\ncompute design for non-hic, status: empty, assigned: Michele, Raf and now @janine\\nsecurity: status: Natty populated it: @Rydekull to review, lean and filter. This is the piece that concerns Vijay\\ndata architecture (i.e. labels and annotation): populated by Gareth. @Shebi to review and approve. @Shebi since you are also following teh migration track, let';s make sure this guidance is implemented. I have not seen those labels on the migrated VMs. I could be wrong though.\\nTertiary Vault: status empty. @Rydekull to populate. Vijay thins that you Alex ha e teh document already and just need to put it in there.\\ncc @Nikos.\\nI hope you guys know where this docs go on confluence. (I still have to figure it out)....", "type": "message", "user": "Raffaele Spazzoli"}]	{"Raffaele Spazzoli"}	2026-05-08 17:54:23.550993+00	2026-05-12 05:07:55.445069+00	delivered	2026-05-09
ddffd8c9-386b-4489-98df-82d894338472	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777708000.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777708000.000000", "text": "[Update 104 to 4.21]\\n@Philip Jones technically speaking, would we be ready to roll 104 to 4.21 soon? (SCSI3-PR, shared disk topic), I saw you gave updates on Operators regarding 4.21 in the build channel, thanks for that.\\n@rspazzol you had a brief sync with Rushikesh on this, that and why we need it?\\nHe is not replying on the Build Team Channel, it is a bit annoying, at some point I would expect green light from him, or not.\\nIn context: There is ongoing demand mounting up to proceed with the Windows Failover Cluster VM shared disk issues.\\nI have been asked to write an Email to Vinay and Narender by today on what our proposed next step is, I guess Sudhir is getting tons of pressure...\\nI want to support him and if we tell them we update 104 to 4.21 soon to continue debug this, we have a positive spin here. (edited)", "type": "message", "user": "U_JENS_9E9831E8"}]	{U_JENS_9E9831E8}	2026-05-25 11:51:52.772272+00	2026-05-27 06:09:54.874611+00	summarized	2026-05-26
