196c562f-bbcf-4c3c-a4af-bfba37710e32	T_EOS_MVP	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	7777708200.000000	\N	1	[{"ts": "7777708200.000000", "text": "[Qemu Issue URGENT]\\nWe need to help support troubleshoot what is happening with the QEMU installation, so we need to a) identify in which Windos OS it works and it doesn.'t -> to see it it is related to OS version b) If it is not OS related, try to figure out similarities that may be causig the errorRosemary Lynch  [10:05 AM]\\n[Time Card entry] Happy Monday team, can you log your RH time cards urgently for last week please? I need to send out the burndown report by noon. Please have your time cards in before 11am GMT. If you have not yet logged your Bank Clarity time sheets please do so at the same time. Those missing: @jfeind  @Rydekull @Anne @Carina Almeida @James Force  @ricardo gregorio @Shebi", "type": "message", "user": "U_PATRIC_80EFC8EB"}]	{U_PATRIC_80EFC8EB}	2026-05-25 11:51:52.785193+00	2026-05-27 06:13:27.315553+00	summarized	2026-05-26
