8388acc6-a0bc-4987-adaf-84adbc2ba96e	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778206849.000169	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778206849.000169", "text": "[dell scalability testing] dell tests cordon and drain with an average of 10 VM and 2 disks per node. this means 20 volumes per node. This test is not realistic, we have asked to rerun the test with 120 volumes per node, which is what the bank expects.", "type": "message", "user": "Raffaele Spazzoli"}]	{"Raffaele Spazzoli"}	2026-05-08 17:54:24.538111+00	2026-05-09 14:13:00.335753+00	pending_retry	2026-05-09
