3dc640ee-e037-40d4-98b0-c46dd846375a	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778235508.000148	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778235508.000148", "text": "@Rydekull I followed up on your idea which you mentioned to Ansell regarding installing qemu-guest-agent on Windows VMs as a pre-hook to reduce the number of reboots. Srinath sees it as a red flag currently installing anything on the VMs before the migration in case of a rollback. Nevertheless I think the idea is not bad, we agreed that I write a proposal to Abhishek to create a new testcase with a VM being migrated that has qemu-agent installed and a vanilla one to see what the time difference would make.", "type": "message", "user": "Jens Feind"}]	{"Jens Feind"}	2026-05-08 17:54:24.25996+00	2026-05-09 15:25:00.089381+00	pending_retry	2026-05-09
