8a73750e-efed-42a9-aec2-cf7643742e08	T01EOS001	153c4abb-b8f9-4e4b-8be0-c6e189ffd9b0	1778207825.000185	\N	1	[{"ts": "1778207825.000185", "text": "hi all - posted this in teams but also doing here as not everybody is on there.. do we have any info / knowledge on supporting the migration of Photon Linux distribution from VMware to OpenShift? Its not on our approved list of certified guest operating systems (thank you @Nikos) but wonder if anyone has come across it or has a pov", "type": "message", "user": "Anne Maskell"}]	{"Anne Maskell"}	2026-05-08 17:54:24.745265+00	2026-05-09 16:56:00.26003+00	pending_retry	2026-05-09
