tion coverage by tomorrow lunch.", "Team members to indicate interest in swapping the May 22nd Red Hat Recharge Day by tomorrow lunch.", "Carina Almeida to finalize coordination with ESS regarding May 22nd migration coverage."], "key_decisions": []}}	[]	approved	\N	2026-05-12 05:07:35.053672+00	2026-05-12 05:04:55.139968+00
