9aabb59a-d1e1-43b1-af4c-84017e666c32	e9ca8050-ffb7-4246-8dae-7d7696f97244	064f2b1a-841c-4113-a5fd-d14ee3573d6b	{"plainSummary": {"body": "Sam Marland is working on a project to identify and list everyone who has made a meaningful contribution to the EOS project. This list is intended to ensure that all key supporters are properly recognized for their work.\\n\\nSam Marland has shared a document where team members can add names that may have been overlooked. Everyone is encouraged to review the list and add any missing contributors to ensure the record is complete.", "headline": "Creating an official list of contributors for the EOS project.", "action_items": ["Team members to review the shared document and add any missing contributors."], "key_decisions": []}, "technicalSummary": {"body": "Sam Marland has initiated a documentation effort to formalize the EOS contributor registry. The objective is to establish a comprehensive list of entities and individuals who have provided significant supporting contributions to the EOS ecosystem.\\n\\nSam Marland has circulated a Google Doc for collaborative auditing and verification of the current contributor roster. Stakeholders are requested to perform a gap analysis and append any missing contributors to ensure the registry accurately reflects the project's collaborative history.", "headline": "Initiation of EOS contributor documentation audit and stakeholder mapping.", "action_items": ["All stakeholders to review and update the EOS contributor Google Doc with missing contributors."], "key_decisions": []}}	{"plainSummary": {"body": "Sam Marland is working on a project to identify and list everyone who has made a meaningful contribution to the EOS project. This list is intended to ensure that all key supporters are properly recognized for their work.\\n\\nSam Marland has shared a document where team members can add names that may have been overlooked. Everyone is encouraged to review the list and add any missing contributors to ensure the record is complete.", "headline": "Creating an official list of contributors for the EOS project.", "action_items": ["Team members to review the shared document and add any missing contributors."], "key_decisions": []}, "technicalSummary": {"body": "Sam Marland has initiated a documentation effort to formalize the EOS contributor registry. The objective is to establish a comprehensive list of entities and individuals who have provided significant supporting contributions to the EOS ecosystem.\\n\\nSam Marland has circulated a Google Doc for collaborative auditing and verification of the current contributor roster. Stakeholders are requested to perform a gap analysis and append any missing contributors to ensure the registry accurately reflects the project's collaborative history.", "headline": "Initiation of EOS contributor documentation audit and stakeholder mapping.", "action_items": ["All stakeholders to review and update the EOS contributor Google Doc with missing contributors."], "key_decisions": []}}	[]	approved	\N	2026-05-12 05:07:35.053672+00	2026-05-12 05:04:55.372103+00
0b639599-f338-4081-9b08-b15c6df03fe6	f25f6990-87c7-4b7d-8b38-e96fc60e3fb0	064f2b1a-841c-4113-a5fd-d14ee3573d6b	{"plainSummary": {"body": "Alexander Rydekull is asking for a clear explanation of the steps required to link a new project environment to our central secret management system, Vault. He wants to confirm the specific hand-off process between our team and the Vault administrators.\\n\\nUnderstanding this process is essential to ensure that new projects can securely access the credentials they need to function. The team is currently waiting for confirmation on whether the current setup involves a manual request process to the Vault team.", "headline": "Clarification requested on how new systems connect to our secure password storage.", "action_items": ["Philip Jones, James Force, and R. Spazzoli to provide the standard procedure for Vault cluster onboarding."], "key_decisions": []}, "technicalSummary": {"body": "Alexander Rydekull initiated a query regarding the current operational workflow for integrating new clusters with HashiCorp Vault. He seeks clarification on the hand-off process, specifically whether the workflow involves generating local cluster credentials and transmitting them to the Vault team for manual provisioning.\\n\\nThe discussion aims to validate the architectural pattern for secret consumption, confirming if the cluster-to-Vault connectivity is established via an external provisioning request followed by standard secret retrieval protocols.", "headline": "Inquiry regarding the HashiCorp Vault cluster integration and secret provisioning workflow.", "action_items": ["Clarify the Vault cluster enrollment and secret provisioning workflow with Philip Jones, James Force, and R. Spazzoli."], "key_decisions": []}}	{"plainSummary": {"body": "Alexander Rydekull is asking for a clear explanation of the steps required to link a new project environment to our central secret management system, Vault. He wants to confirm the specific hand-off process between our team and the Vault administrators.\\n\\nUnderstanding this process is essential to ensure that new projects can securely access the credentials they need to function. The team is currently waiting for confirmation on whether the current setup involves a manual request process to the Vault team.", "headline": "Clarification requested on how new systems connect to our secure password storage.", "action_items": ["Philip Jones, James Force, and R. Spazzoli to provide the standard procedure for Vault cluster onboarding."], "key_decisions": []}, "technicalSummary": {"body": "Alexander Rydekull initiated a query regarding the current operational workflow for integrating new clusters with HashiCorp Vault. He seeks clarification on the hand-off process, specifically whether the workflow involves generating local cluster credentials and transmitting them to the Vault team for manual provisioning.\\n\\nThe discussion aims to validate the architectural pattern for secret consumption, confirming if the cluster-to-Vault connectivity is established via an external provisioning request followed by standard secret retrieval protocols.", "headline": "Inquiry regarding the HashiCorp Vault cluster integration and secret provisioning workflow.", "action_items": ["Clarify the Vault cluster enrollment and secret provisioning workflow with Philip Jones, James Force, and R. Spazzoli."], "key_decisions": []}}	[]	approved	\N	2026-05-12 05:07:35.053672+00	2026-05-12 05:04:55.677491+00
