ore the task is considered complete.", "headline": "Adding a verification step to ensure services work after moving virtual machines.", "action_items": ["Raffaele Spazzoli to coordinate with pdelashe regarding the implementation of a new service verification check."], "key_decisions": []}, "technicalSummary": {"body": "Raffaele Spazzoli has proposed a remediation strategy following an incident retrospective regarding VM migration processes. The suggestion involves integrating an automated validation check to verify the operational status of all Windows services immediately following the completion of a VM migration.\\n\\nThis measure aims to ensure service availability and state consistency post-migration, mitigating risks associated with services failing to initialize correctly after the transition.", "headline": "Proposed implementation of post-migration validation for Windows services.", "action_items": ["Raffaele Spazzoli to propose a post-migration check for Windows service status to pdelashe."], "key_decisions": []}}	[]	approved	\N	2026-05-12 05:07:35.053672+00	2026-05-12 05:04:56.125437+00
