g retrospective session that has exceeded its allocated time block.\\n\\nThis concurrency issue highlights a resource contention between the retrospective and standup workstreams, resulting in a temporary reduction in participant availability for the latter.", "headline": "Participant delay reported due to overlapping synchronous meeting dependencies.", "action_items": ["Patricia de las Heras Granaglia to join standup upon conclusion of the retrospective."], "key_decisions": []}}	[]	approved	\N	2026-05-12 05:07:35.053672+00	2026-05-12 05:04:56.259143+00
