o confirm that our technical choices still align with our original project goals before we move forward with the next release.", "headline": "Evaluating network software options to ensure project requirements are met for the next release.", "action_items": ["Alexander Rydekull to compare the planned features for the 4.22 release against our original project requirements."], "key_decisions": []}, "technicalSummary": {"body": "Alexander Rydekull has initiated a review of the SDN technology evaluation, specifically focusing on the comparative analysis between OVN-Kubernetes and Isovalent/Cilium. The objective is to reconcile the current feature set planned for the 4.22 release against the original requirements defined in previous architectural assessments.\\n\\nThis audit aims to ensure that the transition or selection process aligns with the technical roadmap and that all critical networking capabilities identified in the initial scope are accounted for in the upcoming deployment.", "headline": "Reviewing feature parity between OVN-Kubernetes and Cilium for the 4.22 release cycle.", "action_items": ["Alexander Rydekull to audit previous SDN analysis against the 4.22 release feature set."], "key_decisions": []}}	[]	approved	\N	2026-05-12 05:07:35.053672+00	2026-05-12 05:05:00.3339+00
