ry": {"body": "Patricia de las Heras Granaglia has identified the root cause of the current system failure. The analysis confirms that the dynamic-link library (DLL) is incompatible with the CPU instruction set architecture of the new platform environment.\\n\\nThis architectural mismatch necessitates a review of the binary compatibility requirements for the migration process to ensure the DLL can execute correctly on the target hardware.", "headline": "Root cause identified as DLL incompatibility with target CPU architecture during platform migration.", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": ["Confirmed DLL-to-CPU architecture mismatch as the root cause of the migration failure."]}}	[]	approved	\N	2026-05-12 05:07:35.053672+00	2026-05-12 05:05:03.629202+00
