idating whether a functional pathway exists to achieve the stated project objectives.\\n\\nNo specific architectural constraints or implementation details were provided in this exchange, leaving the feasibility status currently pending further technical validation by Sam Marland.", "headline": "Inquiry regarding the feasibility of the proposed implementation pathway.", "action_items": ["Sam Marland to provide technical validation of the project pathway to Nick Evans."], "key_decisions": []}}	[]	approved	\N	2026-05-12 05:07:35.053672+00	2026-05-12 05:05:04.173705+00
