8248e7ca-a89a-49c8-9a71-a2fae0bdb732	e3c001ad-84da-4932-bf80-b861b2e77686	064f2b1a-841c-4113-a5fd-d14ee3573d6b	{"plainSummary": {"body": "Alexander Rydekull, representing the cybersecurity team, provided an update on the project's infrastructure growth. The team has ordered 48 new server nodes to expand the current HIC 1.0 system.\\n\\nThe current plan is to split these new resources equally, with 24 nodes going to the Hong Kong location to expand existing capacity and 24 nodes going to the Great Britain location.", "headline": "Plans confirmed for adding 48 new server nodes to the HIC 1.0 network.", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": ["24 nodes will be sent to Hong Kong to expand the HIC 1.0 system.", "24 nodes are planned for the Great Britain site."]}, "technicalSummary": {"body": "Alexander Rydekull, acting in a cybersecurity oversight capacity, reported on the procurement of 48 additional nodes for the HIC 1.0 architecture. The deployment plan allocates 24 nodes to the HK region to facilitate HIC 1.0 extension, with the remaining 24 nodes designated for the GB region.\\n\\nRydekull noted that these insights were gathered during the HIC design meeting, confirming the current distribution strategy for the infrastructure expansion.", "headline": "Expansion of HIC 1.0 infrastructure via 48-node deployment across HK and GB regions.", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": ["Allocation of 24 nodes to HK for HIC 1.0 extension.", "Proposed allocation of 24 nodes to GB for HIC 1.0."]}}	{"plainSummary": {"body": "Alexander Rydekull, representing the cybersecurity team, provided an update on the project's infrastructure growth. The team has ordered 48 new server nodes to expand the current HIC 1.0 system.\\n\\nThe current plan is to split these new resources equally, with 24 nodes going to the Hong Kong location to expand existing capacity and 24 nodes going to the Great Britain location.", "headline": "Plans confirmed for adding 48 new server nodes to the HIC 1.0 network.", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": ["24 nodes will be sent to Hong Kong to expand the HIC 1.0 system.", "24 nodes are planned for the Great Britain site."]}, "technicalSummary": {"body": "Alexander Rydekull, acting in a cybersecurity oversight capacity, reported on the procurement of 48 additional nodes for the HIC 1.0 architecture. The deployment plan allocates 24 nodes to the HK region to facilitate HIC 1.0 extension, with the remaining 24 nodes designated for the GB region.\\n\\nRydekull noted that these insights were gathered during the HIC design meeting, confirming the current distribution strategy for the infrastructure expansion.", "headline": "Expansion of HIC 1.0 infrastructure via 48-node deployment across HK and GB regions.", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": ["Allocation of 24 nodes to HK for HIC 1.0 extension.", "Proposed allocation of 24 nodes to GB for HIC 1.0."]}}	[]	approved	\N	2026-05-12 05:07:35.053672+00	2026-05-12 05:05:04.569907+00
