Update on the server move: 8 of 9 servers successfully transferred.", "action_items": ["Patricia de las Heras Granaglia: Complete the migration for the final server within 40 minutes."], "key_decisions": ["Restart the migration process for the single server that failed."]}, "technicalSummary": {"body": "Patricia de las Heras Granaglia reported that the Migration Piloh Phase #2 is currently underway, with 8 out of 9 target machines successfully migrated and validated. \\n\\nOne machine failed the migration process due to a VMTools version incompatibility. Patricia de las Heras Granaglia confirmed that a re-launch of the migration for the affected node is required, with an estimated recovery time of 40 minutes.", "headline": "Migration Piloh Phase #2 status: 8/9 nodes successfully migrated.", "action_items": ["Patricia de las Heras Granaglia: Re-launch migration for the failed machine (estimated 40-minute duration)."], "key_decisions": ["Re-launch migration for the failed node following VMTools version remediation."]}}	[]	approved	\N	2026-05-12 05:07:35.053672+00	2026-05-12 05:05:04.687049+00
