tus and ensure the team is aligned on how these migrations should be handled moving forward.", "headline": "Clarification requested on the setup of a dedicated network for system migrations.", "action_items": ["@rspazzol and @Rydekull to clarify the current status of the migration network setup."], "key_decisions": []}, "technicalSummary": {"body": "James Force has initiated a status check regarding the architectural implementation of a dedicated live migration network. The discussion seeks to clarify the current configuration state of the network infrastructure, specifically regarding whether the team proceeded with a segmented network for migration traffic as previously discussed.\\n\\nJames Force is requesting confirmation from @rspazzol and @Rydekull to verify if a final decision was reached and documented regarding this network isolation strategy.", "headline": "Inquiry regarding the implementation status of a dedicated live migration network architecture.", "action_items": ["@rspazzol and @Rydekull to provide status update on the dedicated live migration network configuration."], "key_decisions": []}}	[]	approved	\N	2026-05-12 05:07:35.053672+00	2026-05-12 05:05:05.429928+00
