ilip Jones: Continue Entra troubleshooting for node 301."], "key_decisions": ["Implemented custom ConfigMap to resolve Dell CSM image pull issues.", "Initiated PR for search PVC on Pure Storage."]}}	[]	approved	\N	2026-05-12 05:07:35.053672+00	2026-05-12 05:05:05.65744+00
