 updated the Migration Pilot2 by rescheduling its commencement from May 4th due to a lull in activities. The on-call team is now inclusive of Janine and Alex, while Shebi remains within us/MX for continuity.", "headline": "Migration Pilot Update: On-call team and start date adjusted, VMs with RDM disks to be moved for migration.", "action_items": [], "key_decisions": ["Reschedule migration start date", "Include new members (Janine & Alex) to the 'on call' team"]}}	[]	approved	\N	2026-05-12 05:07:35.053672+00	2026-05-12 05:05:05.775002+00
