af7f09de-a1cf-4168-8dd1-2fb5ce8de6b4	0acc7785-d98f-493b-9c49-b27fb915d177	1778228660.000020	Philip Jones	Build Team Update:\nCompleted about 50% of the securecodewarrior training HSBC has added to my required courses list.\nSpent a chunk of time trying to get the latest DELL CSM version working. Sadly it doesn't have the correct paths for the images it needs to pull and there's no easy workaround. It will likely require a fix from Dell. Based on their docs here: https://dell.github.io/csm-docs/docs/supportmatrix/component-version/ the images we've mirrored are where they should be, but the container storage module is looking for them under dell, rather than dell-emc. It's also appending an additional folder name to the requests, which we can't replicate.\nAlso requested Durga to investigate an issue with machinesets and machines.\nNew oc-mirror docs now merged.\noc-mirror is now mirroring 4.20 and 4.21 only. Hopefully we will be running oc-mirror delete to prune away 4.19 from Nexus and the local workspace soon.\nDell Technologies\nComponent and Image Details\nContainer Storage Modules Component Version Component Image Version PowerFlex 2.16.1 PowerStore 2.16.0 PowerMax 2.16.2 PowerScale 2.16.0 Unity XT 2.16.0 Authorization v2.x 2.4.0 Observability 1.14.0 Replication 1.14.0 Resiliency 1.15.0 COSI 1.0.0 Container Storage Modules Certified Operator 1.11.3 Images PowerStore Version/Digest Image 1.11.3 registry.connect.redhat.com/dell-emc/dell-container-storage-modules-operator@sha256:9547300ef7cca3a9e3f33ba43d01b3feb99a78c92bae0838b8f152fa90b80e45 2.16.0 registry.connect.redhat.com/dell-emc/dell-csm-powerstore@sha256:4be94a81d2bfdabacb686d3061ef9b71861f21efd6678b23c418c484dd10d2f9 1.14.0 registry.connect.redhat.com/dell-emc/dell-csm-metrics-powerstor… Show more	{"ts": "1778228660.000020", "text": "Build Team Update:\\nCompleted about 50% of the securecodewarrior training HSBC has added to my required courses list.\\nSpent a chunk of time trying to get the latest DELL CSM version working. Sadly it doesn't have the correct paths for the images it needs to pull and there's no easy workaround. It will likely require a fix from Dell. Based on their docs here: https://dell.github.io/csm-docs/docs/supportmatrix/component-version/ the images we've mirrored are where they should be, but the container storage module is looking for them under dell, rather than dell-emc. It's also appending an additional folder name to the requests, which we can't replicate.\\nAlso requested Durga to investigate an issue with machinesets and machines.\\nNew oc-mirror docs now merged.\\noc-mirror is now mirroring 4.20 and 4.21 only. Hopefully we will be running oc-mirror delete to prune away 4.19 from Nexus and the local workspace soon.\\nDell Technologies\\nComponent and Image Details\\nContainer Storage Modules Component Version Component Image Version PowerFlex 2.16.1 PowerStore 2.16.0 PowerMax 2.16.2 PowerScale 2.16.0 Unity XT 2.16.0 Authorization v2.x 2.4.0 Observability 1.14.0 Replication 1.14.0 Resiliency 1.15.0 COSI 1.0.0 Container Storage Modules Certified Operator 1.11.3 Images PowerStore Version/Digest Image 1.11.3 registry.connect.redhat.com/dell-emc/dell-container-storage-modules-operator@sha256:9547300ef7cca3a9e3f33ba43d01b3feb99a78c92bae0838b8f152fa90b80e45 2.16.0 registry.connect.redhat.com/dell-emc/dell-csm-powerstore@sha256:4be94a81d2bfdabacb686d3061ef9b71861f21efd6678b23c418c484dd10d2f9 1.14.0 registry.connect.redhat.com/dell-emc/dell-csm-metrics-powerstor… Show more", "type": "message", "user": "Philip Jones"}
