71217066-1f19-463d-b5c7-627ddbee8093	d9987edc-d032-42aa-83ce-aa52d26ea3fd	1778195853.000153	Alexander Rydekull	OpenShift 5 will no longer be announced at summit btw: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CbmfHX_NXFIK8pWYUKYmCpbVzBJdsQ_Xmr5O7l5k1QE/edit?tab=t.0	{"ts": "1778195853.000153", "text": "OpenShift 5 will no longer be announced at summit btw: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CbmfHX_NXFIK8pWYUKYmCpbVzBJdsQ_Xmr5O7l5k1QE/edit?tab=t.0", "type": "message", "user": "Alexander Rydekull"}
21035b0b-725b-476d-a66d-bfeea5b43b7d	1c2444bf-52a7-44e9-8fad-4e76d5a97ec3	1778204866.000046	Ricardo Gregorio	[collaboration request]\nSRE team has raised a PR to drop alerts with severity info|none using receiver 'null'. Reason noise. Unsure about the possible impact on audit (internal|external) compliance as well as for historical debug/tshoot exercises.\nI have never come across such request before and never thought as to why to have this in place. Everyday is a learning day (for me).\nI am doing some research to understand:\na. is this a good practice or whether it may have a negative impact?\nb. if it is okay to do it, is this approach of adding receiver: null the recommended approach and/or are there any other approaches\nIf anyone has come across this before and/or would like to comment, it is appreciated.	{"ts": "1778204866.000046", "text": "[collaboration request]\\nSRE team has raised a PR to drop alerts with severity info|none using receiver 'null'. Reason noise. Unsure about the possible impact on audit (internal|external) compliance as well as for historical debug/tshoot exercises.\\nI have never come across such request before and never thought as to why to have this in place. Everyday is a learning day (for me).\\nI am doing some research to understand:\\na. is this a good practice or whether it may have a negative impact?\\nb. if it is okay to do it, is this approach of adding receiver: null the recommended approach and/or are there any other approaches\\nIf anyone has come across this before and/or would like to comment, it is appreciated.", "type": "message", "user": "Ricardo Gregorio"}
