a8b5b47c-aa03-4fa5-bd17-9307685053aa	e0147672-6cc7-462a-b14c-df52101fef22	1778207419.000139	Patricia de las Heras Granaglia	[Migration Failure Process Workshop]\nGoal: Improve the failure management as it is not clear who needs to do what, and in particular SLAs\nGoal2: Vinay has asked ACN to be more proactive on the initial Triage\nWe reviewed the process drafted by ACN (Image on Teams) and modified some responsabilities and SLAs\nActions:\na) All Miox Logs posted in Splunk should be available for the team that is doing the triage\nb) ACN to review a Confluence Knowledgebase of Miox Errors = Solutions or whom to call\nc) Escalate to the Program what to do if ITSOs do not respond in the agreed time (30') either rollback or move to hypercare, or someone to talk to ITSO to clarify the importance of responding in time\nd) Red Hat (me) to send our proposal on how we want to collaborate with the Command Center and support triage	{"ts": "1778207419.000139", "text": "[Migration Failure Process Workshop]\\nGoal: Improve the failure management as it is not clear who needs to do what, and in particular SLAs\\nGoal2: Vinay has asked ACN to be more proactive on the initial Triage\\nWe reviewed the process drafted by ACN (Image on Teams) and modified some responsabilities and SLAs\\nActions:\\na) All Miox Logs posted in Splunk should be available for the team that is doing the triage\\nb) ACN to review a Confluence Knowledgebase of Miox Errors = Solutions or whom to call\\nc) Escalate to the Program what to do if ITSOs do not respond in the agreed time (30') either rollback or move to hypercare, or someone to talk to ITSO to clarify the importance of responding in time\\nd) Red Hat (me) to send our proposal on how we want to collaborate with the Command Center and support triage", "type": "message", "user": "Patricia de las Heras Granaglia"}
