2eb472af-7a62-4ac3-8bcd-fe9110bad121	e3cb35b6-0598-40a9-b216-3c7619ebe9cd	1778221525.000145	Carina Almeida	[Resourcing call with Vinay and Programme team]\nTeam,\nAnne and I met with Vinay and the Programme Team today. While the objective was to position the new staff, the discussion evolved into a broader conversation regarding team allocation.\nWe walked them through our Governance and Work Distribution slides, which have now been shared with them for reference.\nA key request from Vinay is that our team maintains an 80% dedication to ENG work. This means ENG tasks take priority over all other activities. In case you have a conflict in priorities, please notify Rose, Patricia, or myself immediately so we can coordinate with ENG for prioritisation. (edited)	{"ts": "1778221525.000145", "text": "[Resourcing call with Vinay and Programme team]\\nTeam,\\nAnne and I met with Vinay and the Programme Team today. While the objective was to position the new staff, the discussion evolved into a broader conversation regarding team allocation.\\nWe walked them through our Governance and Work Distribution slides, which have now been shared with them for reference.\\nA key request from Vinay is that our team maintains an 80% dedication to ENG work. This means ENG tasks take priority over all other activities. In case you have a conflict in priorities, please notify Rose, Patricia, or myself immediately so we can coordinate with ENG for prioritisation. (edited)", "type": "message", "user": "Carina Almeida"}
