3b488bcd-481c-4d6b-91a8-f664e4fd02e4	ac15fc5b-b4cf-468b-ab1f-7c3f06888aab	1778201615.000155	Rosalia Suarez Mejias	[Delivery Report] This is due to go out by noon. I've made a start on the updates but as I was out yesterday there are definite gaps. Can the following review & update by 11am please. @Rydekull, @rspazzol, @Shebi, @janine, @Philip Jones, @James Force ,@ricardo gregorio, @Petros ,@pdelashe appreciate it.	{"ts": "1778201615.000155", "text": "[Delivery Report] This is due to go out by noon. I've made a start on the updates but as I was out yesterday there are definite gaps. Can the following review & update by 11am please. @Rydekull, @rspazzol, @Shebi, @janine, @Philip Jones, @James Force ,@ricardo gregorio, @Petros ,@pdelashe appreciate it.", "type": "message", "user": "Rosalia Suarez Mejias"}
6ab181f3-1bb1-428a-82ef-c589c90b2212	5f16be9f-9753-4f3e-8cf0-7a8485e58c1d	1778205996.000156	Raffaele Spazzoli	[US DC migration] we learned that there is a program level DC migration and we need to sync with them to understand what the process is. The VM migration tool/automation with need to be harmonized with that process. likely they will take care of the network devices (DNS, Loadbalacer, firewall) configuration at the program level, but teh modalities are unknown at this point. Next week there will be a meeting with the DC migration program team to get some insight. @Shebi will follow this part and create a proposal on how the VM migration process will integrate with the larger DC migration process.	{"ts": "1778205996.000156", "text": "[US DC migration] we learned that there is a program level DC migration and we need to sync with them to understand what the process is. The VM migration tool/automation with need to be harmonized with that process. likely they will take care of the network devices (DNS, Loadbalacer, firewall) configuration at the program level, but teh modalities are unknown at this point. Next week there will be a meeting with the DC migration program team to get some insight. @Shebi will follow this part and create a proposal on how the VM migration process will integrate with the larger DC migration process.", "type": "message", "user": "Raffaele Spazzoli"}
