bdda36ff-cc4a-4a36-af9c-32e5ea0db8a0	68951069-1c42-4ea5-9700-1b27a98ee254	1778227840.000160	Philip Jones	PJ Build Update:\nPortworx CSI driver updated to 26.1.1 on all lab clusters.\nLargely successful, but 102 cluster has a MAJOR issue with snapshots... There are >4700 vm snapshots and volumesnapshotcontent resources present, but there are 0 volumesnapshots! This problem is breaking the CSI migration pods and causing them to fail :(\nWe don't have an easy solution or explanation. If we manually create a snapshot, no new snapshot instance is created, just the content and the virtmachine upgrades.	{"ts": "1778227840.000160", "text": "PJ Build Update:\\nPortworx CSI driver updated to 26.1.1 on all lab clusters.\\nLargely successful, but 102 cluster has a MAJOR issue with snapshots... There are >4700 vm snapshots and volumesnapshotcontent resources present, but there are 0 volumesnapshots! This problem is breaking the CSI migration pods and causing them to fail :(\\nWe don't have an easy solution or explanation. If we manually create a snapshot, no new snapshot instance is created, just the content and the virtmachine upgrades.", "type": "message", "user": "Philip Jones"}
