948b455a-76df-4228-a493-863b10d0ab95	5385496f-47c0-4869-869a-50512d1cdaf9	1778204507.000167	Patricia de las Heras Granaglia	[Migration Pilot2 update]\nUpdated the "on call" team for the 1st week to include Janine&Alex as Shebi will be in us/MX\nStart date has been pushed to May 5th (as there is a quite period that finishes on May 4th)\nLooks like some of the VMs with RDM disks are sitting on HP storage that does not support storage offload, so they will be moved to either Pure or Dell before migrating, which will imply > 10m down time\nThey are thinking to create a new Change Request Category to accelerate the ITSO response time (I think they are using Patching now, which doesn't sound much urgent)	{"ts": "1778204507.000167", "text": "[Migration Pilot2 update]\\nUpdated the \\"on call\\" team for the 1st week to include Janine&Alex as Shebi will be in us/MX\\nStart date has been pushed to May 5th (as there is a quite period that finishes on May 4th)\\nLooks like some of the VMs with RDM disks are sitting on HP storage that does not support storage offload, so they will be moved to either Pure or Dell before migrating, which will imply > 10m down time\\nThey are thinking to create a new Change Request Category to accelerate the ITSO response time (I think they are using Patching now, which doesn't sound much urgent)", "type": "message", "user": "Patricia de las Heras Granaglia"}
