b4ceb896-0292-48b5-be77-87a1601740e2	162f84e1-6b4b-41ec-a862-57b4ccf8fcdf	1778226848.000188	Ricardo Gregorio	[observability]\n- customer wants to find a way of 'observing' the cluster build lifecycle, i.e., capturing/monitoring the build phases/progress/failures. This is because over the weekend 4x worker nodes out of 48x did not join a cluster that was built. Unsure how this can be done, so currently researching this. Thank you for helping @janine\n- checked with Cyber team. Cluster 104, last 24h ingested 33.6 million events ~ 59.2G. It seems that they have not checked the contents in regards of what is useful, what is sensitive, etc\n- reviewing Confluence doc in regards to OCP-V Security Requirement Matrix (defined by customer)	{"ts": "1778226848.000188", "text": "[observability]\\n- customer wants to find a way of 'observing' the cluster build lifecycle, i.e., capturing/monitoring the build phases/progress/failures. This is because over the weekend 4x worker nodes out of 48x did not join a cluster that was built. Unsure how this can be done, so currently researching this. Thank you for helping @janine\\n- checked with Cyber team. Cluster 104, last 24h ingested 33.6 million events ~ 59.2G. It seems that they have not checked the contents in regards of what is useful, what is sensitive, etc\\n- reviewing Confluence doc in regards to OCP-V Security Requirement Matrix (defined by customer)", "type": "message", "user": "Ricardo Gregorio"}
c0682a7f-badb-4f2c-825e-9e96afc9735d	86d7495c-f7dc-41b5-b40a-a737654424fb	1778227029.000189	Carina Almeida	[Migration velocity]\n@janine @Shebi @Rydekull iIn our call with ACN today, we agreed to document the specific challenges and constraints that can impact migration velocity.\nWhile the document @Anne prepared outlines our advice to achieve velocity, we now need to explicitly list the challenges and constraints. Could you please add your input to that document? - Go Faster ideas\nACN also raised a question regarding potential Miox restrictions. They were informed that Miox can only migrate 40 VMs in parallel. Are you aware of this limitation, or do you have a views on whether this is accurate?\nThank you so much.\nPS. @Nikos  and @rspazzol for info.	{"ts": "1778227029.000189", "text": "[Migration velocity]\\n@janine @Shebi @Rydekull iIn our call with ACN today, we agreed to document the specific challenges and constraints that can impact migration velocity.\\nWhile the document @Anne prepared outlines our advice to achieve velocity, we now need to explicitly list the challenges and constraints. Could you please add your input to that document? - Go Faster ideas\\nACN also raised a question regarding potential Miox restrictions. They were informed that Miox can only migrate 40 VMs in parallel. Are you aware of this limitation, or do you have a views on whether this is accurate?\\nThank you so much.\\nPS. @Nikos  and @rspazzol for info.", "type": "message", "user": "Carina Almeida"}
