effdd115-5805-48a8-bb9f-3c7150db19e0	bc2fb5dc-7c14-4026-b108-84637d1fa161	1778199675.000195	Carina Almeida	[OTEL vs OCP out of the box demo today]\nTeam, Ravi booked a OTEL vs OCP demo for today at 10.30 am BST - Objective attached.\nHe invited Raffa who's out, is there anyone available, who can demo the RH side of things? or should I ask to postpone this?\n@ricardo gregorio were you aware of this?\n@Rydekull @janine @Shebi do you have time and the skills to help with this?\n@Nikos would we have an SSP by change who could support this kind of demo in future?\nThanks (edited)	{"ts": "1778199675.000195", "text": "[OTEL vs OCP out of the box demo today]\\nTeam, Ravi booked a OTEL vs OCP demo for today at 10.30 am BST - Objective attached.\\nHe invited Raffa who's out, is there anyone available, who can demo the RH side of things? or should I ask to postpone this?\\n@ricardo gregorio were you aware of this?\\n@Rydekull @janine @Shebi do you have time and the skills to help with this?\\n@Nikos would we have an SSP by change who could support this kind of demo in future?\\nThanks (edited)", "type": "message", "user": "Carina Almeida"}
f317b53b-11b1-4b59-b979-995e85280471	c61d9f22-9991-418d-b73e-305a0cab47cd	1778199796.000196	Patricia de las Heras Granaglia	[Migration update]\nPilot Phase 2:\nVMs in scope 212; from 230 in initial scope, some dropped because they’re in the demise path, inventory errors and descoped: 23 ITSOs haven’t responded yet.\nPlan:\nMay 5th from 10:00 -> 13:00 - 46 VMs\nMay 5th from 13:00 -> 16:00 - 47 VMs\nMay 6th from 10:00 -> 13:00 - 49 VMs\nMay 6th from 13:00 -> 16:00 - 42 VMs\nMay 7th from 10:00 -> 13:00 - 28 VMs\nUK Pilot:\nNo delays on the UK Pilot plan; new clusters to be built on track\nPlan:\nMay 13th -> June 15th - Dev & UAT & OAT\nJune 17 -> End of July - Contingency and Prod - Weekdays & Weekends	{"ts": "1778199796.000196", "text": "[Migration update]\\nPilot Phase 2:\\nVMs in scope 212; from 230 in initial scope, some dropped because they’re in the demise path, inventory errors and descoped: 23 ITSOs haven’t responded yet.\\nPlan:\\nMay 5th from 10:00 -> 13:00 - 46 VMs\\nMay 5th from 13:00 -> 16:00 - 47 VMs\\nMay 6th from 10:00 -> 13:00 - 49 VMs\\nMay 6th from 13:00 -> 16:00 - 42 VMs\\nMay 7th from 10:00 -> 13:00 - 28 VMs\\nUK Pilot:\\nNo delays on the UK Pilot plan; new clusters to be built on track\\nPlan:\\nMay 13th -> June 15th - Dev & UAT & OAT\\nJune 17 -> End of July - Contingency and Prod - Weekdays & Weekends", "type": "message", "user": "Patricia de las Heras Granaglia"}
