44a40f78-79c1-4d4f-8d16-0fe4efccff97	bb8bcf1a-80b5-47a0-83fd-1e0f2a67977a	1778217024.000204	Alexander Rydekull	I just noticed....\nThe customer seems to have issue with the prod clusters. To the point that they were completely down, due to network changes. While I understand that there's a certain process and procedure in place on how to deal with it, it'd be nice if we can at least spread the news amongst ourselves so it doesn't come as a surprise to us. (edited)	{"ts": "1778217024.000204", "text": "I just noticed....\\nThe customer seems to have issue with the prod clusters. To the point that they were completely down, due to network changes. While I understand that there's a certain process and procedure in place on how to deal with it, it'd be nice if we can at least spread the news amongst ourselves so it doesn't come as a surprise to us. (edited)", "type": "message", "user": "Alexander Rydekull"}
