75c70ac1-dd00-4aa5-875d-e35d0a7fafcc	d4e2e550-18af-4594-a768-f7d917b239bb	1778212519.000259	Raffaele Spazzoli	[HK and re-ip] Vinay yesterday casually dropped that some VMs in HK will need Re-iping. We are learning how hard it is to re-ip here in NY. couple of things that came out yesterday that we didn't think about: OS-mounted NAS, VPNs, proxies. they are all also affected by the VM's IP change. (edited)	{"ts": "1778212519.000259", "text": "[HK and re-ip] Vinay yesterday casually dropped that some VMs in HK will need Re-iping. We are learning how hard it is to re-ip here in NY. couple of things that came out yesterday that we didn't think about: OS-mounted NAS, VPNs, proxies. they are all also affected by the VM's IP change. (edited)", "type": "message", "user": "Raffaele Spazzoli"}
