e5ff8b6c-1e95-4a19-a915-c1c72648506d	92c7fadf-8f51-405c-8de9-07ea2cab746e	1778201864.000284	Janine Eichler	[Descheduler] turns out the descheduler's AffinityAndTaints Profile doesn't take preferred scheduling into consideration, only requiredDuringScheduling. existing RFE: https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RFE-7370. @Rydekull @Shebi @rspazzol - anyone got other ideas to get the workloads re-balanced to their preferred sites in the HIC  scenario (site A is lost, VMs are started on site B, at some point site A is back) other than using external automation?	{"ts": "1778201864.000284", "text": "[Descheduler] turns out the descheduler's AffinityAndTaints Profile doesn't take preferred scheduling into consideration, only requiredDuringScheduling. existing RFE: https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RFE-7370. @Rydekull @Shebi @rspazzol - anyone got other ideas to get the workloads re-balanced to their preferred sites in the HIC  scenario (site A is lost, VMs are started on site B, at some point site A is back) other than using external automation?", "type": "message", "user": "Janine Eichler"}
