d6ac8609-1e38-48c7-ace1-7ac18f1afe01	c4ed34d8-44c8-49e5-9967-485c219a8cc8	1778675581.000001	Eve	That table has 50 million rows without proper indexing. We need to add a compound index on user_id and created_at columns immediately.	{"ts": "1778675581.000001", "text": "That table has 50 million rows without proper indexing. We need to add a compound index on user_id and created_at columns immediately.", "type": "message", "user": "Eve"}
bbd8da3d-c4d0-411d-b5f7-d31e462af6c3	ef33387b-05ab-4f2c-a743-7844d353d63e	1778675702.000002	Dana	I ran EXPLAIN ANALYZE and confirmed the sequential scan. The query planner isn't using the existing user_id index because the date range filter is too broad.	{"ts": "1778675702.000002", "text": "I ran EXPLAIN ANALYZE and confirmed the sequential scan. The query planner isn't using the existing user_id index because the date range filter is too broad.", "type": "message", "user": "Dana"}
