67dfd15a-3a53-4e58-90ab-42730c510b75	3365fa99-003e-47ac-a8e4-5a93b37e8738	7777721200.000000	U_CARINA_D5667D0C	:alert-1190: Annoying PM reminder:\n\n@rspazzol @James Force @jfeind you have bank training due soon - please see the thread.\n\nFor the others please double check your training portal :upside_down_face:	{"ts": "7777721200.000000", "text": ":alert-1190: Annoying PM reminder:\\n\\n@rspazzol @James Force @jfeind you have bank training due soon - please see the thread.\\n\\nFor the others please double check your training portal :upside_down_face:", "type": "message", "user": "U_CARINA_D5667D0C"}
da2c081e-3c75-4916-a9bd-ac1fad4c1761	39f5297d-ba21-4263-8b0c-5eb93398adc5	7777700000.000000	U_SEBAST_AC383055	[Build Standup Call]: @Philip Jones keep me honest here, so we give more context to @janine before joining the call. For building new clusters with ACM the secret is getting refreshed unexpectedly, causing the InfraEnv variables and the ISO image to fluctuate. Because the ISO keeps changing, the ISO attachment process frequently fails, throwing “ISO is not ready” errors. the team is relying on a manual process to create and apply these secrets to bypass the failures. To fix this, we need to finalize our automated secret management strategy. We need an automated way to pull these secrets, integrate them with Vault for proper password rotation, and reliably replicate them down to the managed clusters without breaking the deployment flow.	{"ts": "7777700000.000000", "text": "[Build Standup Call]: @Philip Jones keep me honest here, so we give more context to @janine before joining the call. For building new clusters with ACM the secret is getting refreshed unexpectedly, causing the InfraEnv variables and the ISO image to fluctuate. Because the ISO keeps changing, the ISO attachment process frequently fails, throwing “ISO is not ready” errors. the team is relying on a manual process to create and apply these secrets to bypass the failures. To fix this, we need to finalize our automated secret management strategy. We need an automated way to pull these secrets, integrate them with Vault for proper password rotation, and reliably replicate them down to the managed clusters without breaking the deployment flow.", "type": "message", "user": "U_SEBAST_AC383055"}
