1c7e2cec-8811-4db6-98b6-0c36aeefc921	be96b70d-c128-4676-901e-3963c0a9eb32	7777704806.000000	U_PATRIC_80EFC8EB	[Migration Update]\nTomorrow we are again running migrations with no DEL storage; They haven't publishd the plan yet but it is highly probalme that the 8:00 AM Mingraiotn is cancelled and the other ones will run. I'll post more info as soon as ACN shares the detailed planCarina Almeida  [5:32 PM]\n:battery: Happy Recharge Day, Red Hatters! :battery:\nWishing the whole team a fantastic and relaxing long weekend. I hope everyone manage to take some time off to get recharged!\n\n:hammer_and_wrench: A massive thank you to the colleagues who is logging on tomorrow to cover migrations and to the ones working on Monday. Thank you for holding down the fort!\n\n:flag-in: Finally, safe travels to the team heading off to India this weekend.\n\nHave a great weekend, all! :sunglasses:\nimage.png Carina Almeida  [5:44 PM]\nand just before we all go.....\n\n:training_done:\nHSBC Season 2 training is now on with all about People and Culture.\n\nPlease make sure you have your HSBC training done in time :wink:	{"ts": "7777704806.000000", "text": "[Migration Update]\\nTomorrow we are again running migrations with no DEL storage; They haven't publishd the plan yet but it is highly probalme that the 8:00 AM Mingraiotn is cancelled and the other ones will run. I'll post more info as soon as ACN shares the detailed planCarina Almeida  [5:32 PM]\\n:battery: Happy Recharge Day, Red Hatters! :battery:\\nWishing the whole team a fantastic and relaxing long weekend. I hope everyone manage to take some time off to get recharged!\\n\\n:hammer_and_wrench: A massive thank you to the colleagues who is logging on tomorrow to cover migrations and to the ones working on Monday. Thank you for holding down the fort!\\n\\n:flag-in: Finally, safe travels to the team heading off to India this weekend.\\n\\nHave a great weekend, all! :sunglasses:\\nimage.png Carina Almeida  [5:44 PM]\\nand just before we all go.....\\n\\n:training_done:\\nHSBC Season 2 training is now on with all about People and Culture.\\n\\nPlease make sure you have your HSBC training done in time :wink:", "type": "message", "user": "U_PATRIC_80EFC8EB", "thread_ts": "7777704800.000000"}
