4575c3dc-809e-47c2-8f1c-a935a4eaab8c	bcd8641a-6aa4-46c4-98a7-77bdd67d7e9b	7777707700.000000	U_CARINA_D5667D0C	[Migration team cover for the next two weeks]\n\n@pdelashe – I  mentioned we would address this on Monday, but I’ve moved it up as I realised there is a bank holiday in Germany next week.\n\nTeam,\n\n\nNext week, the bank is planning to migrate approximately 230 VMs across Wednesday, Thursday, and Friday. Since Thursday is a bank holiday in Germany, we need to ensure coverage. @atolani @ricardo gregorio @rspazzol @Rydekull do you have availability to cover for @Shebi and @jfeind? We need one arch and one Consultant for Thursday.\nMay 22nd is a Red Hat Recharge Day. We are currently coordinating with ESS to see if they can cover migrations that day. However, I would like to know if anyone is interested in a day swap: working on the 22nd and taking your Recharge Day at another date. This would help us with coordination. \n\n\nPlease let me know your availability for the cover and the swap by lunch time tomorrow. :pray:\n\nTagging who's not tagged yet: @janine @James Force @Philip Jones @Petros	{"ts": "7777707700.000000", "text": "[Migration team cover for the next two weeks]\\n\\n@pdelashe – I  mentioned we would address this on Monday, but I’ve moved it up as I realised there is a bank holiday in Germany next week.\\n\\nTeam,\\n\\n\\nNext week, the bank is planning to migrate approximately 230 VMs across Wednesday, Thursday, and Friday. Since Thursday is a bank holiday in Germany, we need to ensure coverage. @atolani @ricardo gregorio @rspazzol @Rydekull do you have availability to cover for @Shebi and @jfeind? We need one arch and one Consultant for Thursday.\\nMay 22nd is a Red Hat Recharge Day. We are currently coordinating with ESS to see if they can cover migrations that day. However, I would like to know if anyone is interested in a day swap: working on the 22nd and taking your Recharge Day at another date. This would help us with coordination. \\n\\n\\nPlease let me know your availability for the cover and the swap by lunch time tomorrow. :pray:\\n\\nTagging who's not tagged yet: @janine @James Force @Philip Jones @Petros", "type": "message", "user": "U_CARINA_D5667D0C"}
