c8572819-45ff-4d63-905b-11624ca06da6	23dcc11b-f398-4818-b8e1-07a869dcf450	7777714300.000000	U_ANNE_7F9C7274	Hi all - Are we involved in any of the discussions here?\n\non the risk call today there is concern that the demise of the source VM hardware and a rebuild as a OpenShift is a risk to the velocity of the migrations as 1 this hasnt been tested and 2 the demise process isnt fully cordinated.  @James Force - is there any discussion in the build stream about these rebuilds? (edited)	{"ts": "7777714300.000000", "text": "Hi all - Are we involved in any of the discussions here?\\n\\non the risk call today there is concern that the demise of the source VM hardware and a rebuild as a OpenShift is a risk to the velocity of the migrations as 1 this hasnt been tested and 2 the demise process isnt fully cordinated.  @James Force - is there any discussion in the build stream about these rebuilds? (edited)", "type": "message", "user": "U_ANNE_7F9C7274"}
