0c147109-1484-4ce5-ab07-bcc2f88eb536	9593e551-b537-4eca-b44f-e6ad21289da8	7777717100.000000	U_CARINA_D5667D0C	Hey team,\n\nfor the ones who are off tomorrow, I hope you all manage to switch off and rest :vacation_relax:\nfor the ones off on Monday, I'll resend this message tomorrow :upside_down_face:\nimage.png Philip Jones  [5:45 PM]\n[Isovalent Update]\n\nLargely just confirming the version that we'll be installing for the POC phase 2. \nLast time all the clusters were agent based installations so I've suggested that this time we build one ACM cluster and build the second cluster from that instead. This should more closely represent the build process HSBC will use for the majority of their clusters.\nWill need to provide some info in POCDOC to assist with ACM install etc.	{"ts": "7777717100.000000", "text": "Hey team,\\n\\nfor the ones who are off tomorrow, I hope you all manage to switch off and rest :vacation_relax:\\nfor the ones off on Monday, I'll resend this message tomorrow :upside_down_face:\\nimage.png Philip Jones  [5:45 PM]\\n[Isovalent Update]\\n\\nLargely just confirming the version that we'll be installing for the POC phase 2. \\nLast time all the clusters were agent based installations so I've suggested that this time we build one ACM cluster and build the second cluster from that instead. This should more closely represent the build process HSBC will use for the majority of their clusters.\\nWill need to provide some info in POCDOC to assist with ACM install etc.", "type": "message", "user": "U_CARINA_D5667D0C"}
