ecd56bcd-7acc-4c2c-8ca8-3c01f70f95cf	196cc39d-1527-46cb-b847-d8bee7c6ab9c	7777717400.000000	U_CARINA_D5667D0C	Now for the ones who are off on Monday.... Have a great weekend, I hope you all manage to switch off and rest :vacation_relax:\nimage.png [3:35 PM]and one question for the ones working on Monday....\n\nWe will be in a workshop with ACN on Tuesday to discuss what challenges we have to achieve velocity.\nPlease add anything you think we should consider in the Go faster document.\n\nThank you :pray: (edited)	{"ts": "7777717400.000000", "text": "Now for the ones who are off on Monday.... Have a great weekend, I hope you all manage to switch off and rest :vacation_relax:\\nimage.png [3:35 PM]and one question for the ones working on Monday....\\n\\nWe will be in a workshop with ACN on Tuesday to discuss what challenges we have to achieve velocity.\\nPlease add anything you think we should consider in the Go faster document.\\n\\nThank you :pray: (edited)", "type": "message", "user": "U_CARINA_D5667D0C"}
