d834a913-0f07-4754-ae45-34bbca9e1b15	bbef0e20-4de3-4490-86b6-813261149004	7777718900.000000	U_SAM_F28235E5	Update on the plan for oauth proxy. \nhey Sam, we are still assessing all the work that needs to happen. at this point we believe that making this change for the oauth stack is something we will target to backport to 4.22. we are still looking at all the edge cases, so we don't have a firm commitment on exactly what date it would land, but we're trying to get this done in the 5.0 release timeframe and then work on a backport once that's done.\n\nwe're tracking all that effort here https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/OCPSTRAT-3174, and I'll keep regular weekly updates in that ticket\nFrom a private conversation | May 6thPatricia de las Heras Granaglia  [10:22 AM]\n[Delivery Report]\nLast chance to add your comments to the delivery report before it goes out: https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1AZG2KXxtiPZAKWUXIVvEu9h8F1UjaLIB/edit?slide=id.g39a69ff70c8_3_0#slide=id.g39a69ff70c8_3_0	{"ts": "7777718900.000000", "text": "Update on the plan for oauth proxy. \\nhey Sam, we are still assessing all the work that needs to happen. at this point we believe that making this change for the oauth stack is something we will target to backport to 4.22. we are still looking at all the edge cases, so we don't have a firm commitment on exactly what date it would land, but we're trying to get this done in the 5.0 release timeframe and then work on a backport once that's done.\\n\\nwe're tracking all that effort here https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/OCPSTRAT-3174, and I'll keep regular weekly updates in that ticket\\nFrom a private conversation | May 6thPatricia de las Heras Granaglia  [10:22 AM]\\n[Delivery Report]\\nLast chance to add your comments to the delivery report before it goes out: https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1AZG2KXxtiPZAKWUXIVvEu9h8F1UjaLIB/edit?slide=id.g39a69ff70c8_3_0#slide=id.g39a69ff70c8_3_0", "type": "message", "user": "U_SAM_F28235E5"}
f4cc963d-df6a-4b5c-b3ac-3029fb3d549d	a4431f4b-5d9e-4165-9c0b-9be2121a303d	7777719000.000000	U_SAM_F28235E5	Case - https://access.redhat.com/support/cases/#/case/04442406\n\nAbhishek has raised this case over night. It appears linked to the issue from yesterday with the machine with many disks. My intention is to share this ASAP in the migration-blockers-nda-customer channel for focus. It is going to be difficult to get focus with everyone about to travel to Summit. @Rydekull I think you're closest to this from a debug perspective. Can you share any more context you've seen during debugging so we can help engineering?	{"ts": "7777719000.000000", "text": "Case - https://access.redhat.com/support/cases/#/case/04442406\\n\\nAbhishek has raised this case over night. It appears linked to the issue from yesterday with the machine with many disks. My intention is to share this ASAP in the migration-blockers-nda-customer channel for focus. It is going to be difficult to get focus with everyone about to travel to Summit. @Rydekull I think you're closest to this from a debug perspective. Can you share any more context you've seen during debugging so we can help engineering?", "type": "message", "user": "U_SAM_F28235E5"}
