7a7e4afc-4e05-4b39-9e00-b68c0a6d47bd	5dfa65ce-14b0-450b-a3d8-125ddfea110d	9999900010.000000	U_TEST2	Sprint velocity is tracking well — we completed 34 points last sprint. For Q3 planning, we should allocate capacity for the observability epic and the OpenShift migration.	{"ts": "9999900010.000000", "text": "Sprint velocity is tracking well — we completed 34 points last sprint. For Q3 planning, we should allocate capacity for the observability epic and the OpenShift migration.", "type": "message", "user": "U_TEST2"}
12b6a868-cd36-4f11-9479-84d7514e5caa	5dfa65ce-14b0-450b-a3d8-125ddfea110d	9999900011.000000	U_TEST1	The OpenShift migration is critical. We need to move from Docker Compose to proper deployments by end of July. Can we get the infra team involved early?	{"ts": "9999900011.000000", "text": "The OpenShift migration is critical. We need to move from Docker Compose to proper deployments by end of July. Can we get the infra team involved early?", "type": "message", "user": "U_TEST1", "thread_ts": "9999900010.000000"}
